Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:08.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}{\fad(200,200)\pos(970.893,187.223)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果\N♡无偿翻译，用爱发电♡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.49,0:00:11.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0\pos(968.894,899.223)}{\fad(200,200)\pos(967.56,109.89)\fs77}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:03.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}把矩阵化为行阶梯形
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:03.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}reducing a matrix to its row echelon form
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:07.85,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}求解由该矩阵所表示的方程组是完全相同的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:07.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}is the exact same as solving the system of equations that it’s made from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.09,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有什么问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.09,0:00:12.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嗯 我们什么时候能用上这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.09,0:00:12.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Yeah, uh, when will we ever need this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你有没有遇到过这种情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Has this ever happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你是否曾希望你的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Have you ever wished that your students would pay attention
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:25.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在他们荒芜无意义的人生里 哪怕认真一次？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.45,0:00:25.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}for once in their desolate, meaningless lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}隆重介绍……我的世界：教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Introducing… Minecraft: Education Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:31.79,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}研究表明 学生通过Minecraft学习时更有动力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:31.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Studies show that students are more motivated when they learn through Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:35.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而学生更有动力时 他们记住的信息也更多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.79,0:00:35.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And when students are more motivated, they hold on to more information.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:38.09,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft可以教授你能想到的任何科目
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:38.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft can teach any subject you can think of,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:43.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让教师从讲台上的圣人 变成非凡学习之旅身边的向导
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:43.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}turning the teacher from a sage on the stage to a guide on the side of incredible learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:46.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}教育版让学习更有趣、更具包容性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:46.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Education Edition makes learning more fun and inclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:48.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}今天就来看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:48.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Check it out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:52.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}好吧 如果教育版Minecraft这么好 那我们为什么不把它娶回家呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:52.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Okay, well, if educational Minecraft is so good, then why don’t we marry it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:56.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它看起来确实能完全取代学校
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:56.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It sure does seem like it could just replace school entirely,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.31,0:00:59.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但当你真正开始用它时……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.31,0:00:59.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but when you actually start using it, ehhhh…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我说这话一点也不夸张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I’m not exaggerating when I say that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:06.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}教育版是微软目前开发的最烂的Minecraft版本
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:06.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Education Edition is the worst Minecraft version that Microsoft currently develops.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:11.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它昂贵、不可靠、充满bugjump 还在主动传播错误信息
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:11.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s expensive, unreliable, broken, and actively spreads incorrect information.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:13.17,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你知道的 全是老师们最爱的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:13.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Y’know, all things that teachers love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:15.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们几乎没更新过任何功能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:15.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They’ve barely updated any of the features
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:18.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}自从十年前它随基岩版一同发布以来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:18.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}since it initially released with Bedrock Edition a decade ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:23.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}下载课程的网站仍然不可用 距离被要求修复已经过去好几年了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:23.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The website where you download the lessons is still broken, years after it was asked to be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:28.51,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这个版本的所有决策都暴露了微软对教育的真实想法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:28.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}All of the decisions in this version show what Microsoft actually thinks about education,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:32.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那就是他们想要全部好处 却连最低限度都不愿做到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:32.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which is that they want all of the benefit while doing less than the bare minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:34.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而我之所以知道它有多烂 是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:34.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And the reason I know it’s bad is because
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:38.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在这之前 我们曾经有一个好得多的教师版本
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:38.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}we used to have a much better version for teachers before this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:43.17,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那个版本展示了如果微软真的在乎教师 他们会怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.63,0:01:43.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This version shows what Microsoft would do if they actually cared about the teachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:45.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而不只是想着从他们身上榨钱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.17,0:01:45.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}not just wanting to extract money out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.47,0:01:47.17,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它直观、易用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.47,0:01:47.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s intuitive, easy to use,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:52.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}可靠到在被教育版杀死十多年后仍然能运行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and so reliable that it still works more than a decade after it was killed by Education Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:56.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这个古老的、获Mojang认可的Minecraft模组简直不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:56.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This old Mojang-approved Minecraft mod is incredible,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:59.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但它在教育版的冲击下基本被遗忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:59.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it has basically been forgotten in the wake of Education Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那么 那个版本到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So what was this version?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:02.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它又怎么会变成现在这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:02.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}How did it become this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.71,0:02:06.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而为什么微软似乎连教育版自己都不在乎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.71,0:02:06.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And why does Microsoft seem to not even care about Education Edition?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:09.48,CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(938.667,759.667)}学习咨询
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:12.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}故事要一直追溯到Beta 1.0版本
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:12.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The story goes all the way back to Beta 1.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:15.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}下界是万圣节更新中一个全新的特性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:15.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The Nether is a brand new feature in the Halloween update,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:19.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而Minecraft整体的人气也在飞速攀升
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:19.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and Minecraft as a whole is very quickly ramping up in popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:22.94,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它变得如此受欢迎 许多老师开始注意到它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:22.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s getting so popular that many teachers were starting to find out about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:26.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}大概是通过那些上课时偷偷玩它的痴迷学生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:26.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}probably through their obsessed students playing it during class.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:31.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}很多学校的IT部门会立刻来个360°跳杀瞬狙式封禁Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:31.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Many school IT departments would instantly 360 ladder-stall no-scope Minecraft immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:34.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但一些教育工作者把这种痴迷视为机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:34.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but some educators saw that obsession as an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:36.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}其中一位就是Santeri Koivisto
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:36.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}One such educator was Santeri Koivisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:39.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不 不是那个著名的钢管舞者 是这个书呆子大学生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:39.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}No, not the famous pole dancer, okay, this nerdy college kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}听我说完天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Stay with me. Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他即将获得教育学学士学位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}He’s about to get his bachelor’s degree in education,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:45.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他是一名代课老师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:45.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}he’s a substitute teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:48.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他创办了一家名为Study Consulting Group的辅导公司
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:48.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}he started a tutoring company called Study Consulting Group,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:51.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且他逮着机会就狂吹自己这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.23,0:02:51.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and he’s glazing himself about it every second he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:53.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“暑假今天就结束了”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:53.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“The summer holiday ends today”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:55.69,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:55.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:58.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“暑假今天就结束了 我们又该去辛苦劳作了”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:58.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“The summer holiday ends today, and we get to toil once more.”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:02.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“接下来的三周将是本公司历史上最有大事发生的三周”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:02.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“The next three weeks will be the most eventful in this company’s history.”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:04.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“宣传单已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:04.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“Advertising sheets are now ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:08.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}很快它们就会出现在学校、市场等地的墙上 供人惊叹”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:08.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and soon they’ll be marveled at on the walls of schools, markets, and the like.”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:12.64,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}尽管他们的Facebook主页总共只有四个赞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is despite the fact that their Facebook page had four likes in total,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:14.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}其中三个还来自他的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:14.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}three of which were from his family members.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:18.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们有一个我这辈子见过最烂的logo之一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:18.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They have one of the worst logos that I’ve ever seen in my entire life,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:22.15,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而我们只有证据证明有一批学生真的接受过辅导
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:22.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and we only have proof of one set of students actually getting tutored.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.15,0:03:25.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}于是在2010年底 他暂停下来专注于完成学位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.15,0:03:25.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So in late 2010, he took a break to focus on getting his degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:28.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他上了一门关于跨媒介教学的课
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.60,0:03:28.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}He was in a class that was about teaching across multiple mediums,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:32.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他偶然产生了在课堂上使用这款新方块游戏的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:32.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and he stumbled upon the idea of using this new block game in the classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:37.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}作为课程的一部分 他和三个朋友在附近一所小学进行了试运行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:37.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So as part of the class, he and three friends did a trial run at a small school nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:39.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}学生们通过它学习 这很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:39.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The students were learning through it, which was cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:43.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但真正说服Santeri的 是其他老师的反响
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:43.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But what really convinced Santeri was the response from the other teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:45.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们被Minecraft迷住了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:45.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They were enamored by Minecraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:48.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并开始各自思考能用它做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:48.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and they started independently thinking about what they could do with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:50.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}以及他们的同事能用它做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:50.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and what their colleagues could do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:54.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这款游戏并不真正适合老师 它有bug 安装也有点麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:54.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The game’s not really fit for teachers, it’s buggy and kinda hard to install.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:57.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但只要稍加修改 它就能表现得出色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:57.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But with a bit of modification, it could do super well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:03:58.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦！好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:03:58.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh! Uh, great idea:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:01.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果由他来制作那个模组呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:01.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What if he is the one to make that mod?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.37,0:04:03.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}一个专门为教师打造的一站式商店
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.37,0:04:03.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}A one-stop shop just for teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:07.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0\fs 78}制作自定义课程所需的一切 都可以完整地放进一个Minecraft模组里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.39,0:04:07.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Everything you need to make custom lessons could be fully inside of a Minecraft mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:09.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且你可以让安装变得超级简单
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:09.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And you could make it super easy to install
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:14.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这样所有感兴趣的老师们 只需几个小时就能把它装好跑起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:14.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so that all those interested teachers could get it up and running in, like, just a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}酷！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:15.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:17.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但是 具体要怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:17.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But, um, how do you do that exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:20.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“安装简单”到底是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:20.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What does “easy to install” even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:23.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}老师们需要这款游戏有哪些“生物特性”？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:23.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What creature features do teachers need for this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:26.97,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你要如何向一个从未玩过电子游戏的人介绍Minecraft？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:26.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}How do you introduce Minecraft to somebody who’s never played a video game before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}或者……从未用过电脑的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.97,0:04:29.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Or… never used a computer before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:31.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}一堂Minecraft课到底会是什么样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:31.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What would a lesson in Minecraft even look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:33.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}要回答所有这些问题 他需要去询问 比如……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}To answer all those questions, he would need to ask, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:36.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}数百名学生和老师 然后取个平均值
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:36.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}hundreds of students and teachers and get the average.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:38.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他到底要怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:38.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}How the hell is he gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:39.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嘿 你听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:39.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Hey, have you heard of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:42.28,CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(949.333,729)}科学节
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:46.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这可是全芬兰最大的小学生和老师集会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:45.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s only the largest convention of elementary school students and their teachers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:46.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}in all of Finland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:48.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且就在他的学校举办！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:48.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And it’s at his school!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:49.69,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}就在三个月后！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:49.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}In three months!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那可真巧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh, well, that’s convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:55.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri和另外五个同学将在SciFest上办一个Minecraft展位
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:55.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri and five other classmates would run a Minecraft exhibit at SciFest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:57.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}乐高的展位一定对此相当不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:57.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The LEGO booth must have been pretty angry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:59.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在为期四天的集会上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:04:59.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Over the four-day convention,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:03.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们向一千多名学生介绍了Minecraft及其系统
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:03.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they got to introduce Minecraft and its systems to over 1,000 students.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:04.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而这个数字其实还是偏低的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And that number was actually low,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:07.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为还有一千名学生想玩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:07.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because another 1,000 students wanted to play,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:11.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但整个集会期间展位一直爆满 没能玩上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:11.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but couldn’t because they were at capacity the whole entire convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:15.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这让他们对如何向任何新学生介绍Minecraft有了大量见解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:15.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This gave them a ton of perspectives on how you introduce Minecraft to any new student.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:16.91,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果你对游戏一无所知
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:16.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If you don’t know anything about the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:19.97,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}老师讲解操作、世界和机制
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:19.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}a teacher lecturing about the controls, world, and mechanics
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}是最好的入门方式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}is the best way to get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.54,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但已经了解Minecraft的学生觉得这些无聊透顶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But students who already do know about Minecraft find those really boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:27.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们更喜欢自己在网上学习
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.54,0:05:27.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They prefer to learn for themselves on the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:29.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}为了解决这个问题 他们把介绍方式错开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:29.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}To solve this, they staggered their introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.44,0:05:32.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}一组人看YouTube视频或浏览wiki
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.44,0:05:32.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}One group watches a YouTube video or browses the wiki,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:33.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而另一组则接受讲解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:33.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}while the other is getting lectured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:35.94,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}然后所有人会同时进入游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:35.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And they would all get on the game at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:38.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}学生们会被要求把名字首字母刻在地上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:38.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The students would be told to carve their initials into the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}或者盖一座小房子来熟悉操作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:41.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}or build a small house to get them used to the controls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:45.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只有完成所有这些之后 才能给学生一个要实现的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:45.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And only after all of that could they give the students a goal to achieve,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:48.04,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}无论是构想和创造一个环境
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:48.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}whether it be imagining and creating an environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:49.81,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还是在社会中生活
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:49.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}or living in a society.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:54.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri发现 Minecraft不会自动让学生投入其中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:54.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri would find out that Minecraft wasn’t automatically engaging on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.07,0:05:57.19,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只有当老师每一步都做对时 学生才会感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.07,0:05:57.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Students were only interested if the teacher did everything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:06:00.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}否则 学生们真的可以直接走人 去乐高展位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.19,0:06:00.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If not, the students could literally just leave and go over to the LEGO booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.64,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}老师们需要有吸引力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The teachers needed to be engaging,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.64,0:06:04.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且需要很多老师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.64,0:06:04.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and they needed a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.27,0:06:08.00,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们最终确定的配比大约是每八名学生配一位老师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.27,0:06:08.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The ratio they landed on was about one teacher for every eight students,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:13.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而一般小学的配比是每21名学生才有一位老师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:13.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}whereas the average elementary school only has one teacher for every 21 students.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:16.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我想说的是 Minecraft不是什么免费的教具
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.27,0:06:16.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What I’m trying to say is that Minecraft is not some kind of free teaching tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}把它摆在学生面前不是神奇的作弊码
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:19.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Putting it in front of a student isn’t a magical cheat code,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:20.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你仍然得正确地使用它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.18,0:06:20.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you’ve still got to do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:24.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而传授正确的用法 就是他做这个模组的总体目标
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:24.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And relaying how to do it right would be his overall goal with this mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:27.73,CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961.333,735.667)}生意人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:30.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri是个生意人 所以自然而然地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:30.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri is a businessman, so naturally,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:33.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他想把这个小小的模组想法变成一门真正的生意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:33.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}he wanted to turn this small mod idea into an actual business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.95,0:06:34.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不过在当时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.95,0:06:34.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}At the time though,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:37.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}做Minecraft模组根本赚不到什么钱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:37.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}there wasn’t really any money in making Minecraft mods,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:39.79,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}尤其是这么小众的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:39.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}especially for something this niche.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:41.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}于是在3月23日
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:41.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So, on March 23rd,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.25,0:06:44.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri给Mojang发了一封邮件 详细说明了他的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.25,0:06:44.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri sent an email to Mojang detailing his plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:46.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“我在等一封来自瑞典的邮件”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:46.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“I’m waiting for an email from Sweden.”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:49.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“如果它带来好消息 一个巨大的齿轮就将开始转动……”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:49.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“If it brings positive news, then a big wheel will start turning…”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:51.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“一个比以前更大的齿轮”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:51.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“An even bigger one than before.”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:52.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}然后……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:52.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:53.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们完全无视了它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:53.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they completely ignored it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:55.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为……他们当然会这样？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.96,0:06:55.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Because… of course they did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:57.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这家伙到底是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:57.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Who the fuck even is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:07:00.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}作为回应 Santeri开始在Twitter上含含糊糊地发帖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:07:00.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}In response, Santeri started vagueposting about it on Twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.05,0:07:03.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}4月3日 为了让这件事成真做最后的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.05,0:07:03.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}On April 3rd, in a final attempt to get this to work,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:06.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他跑到Notch的Twitter上开始求他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:06.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}he went to Notch’s Twitter and just started pleading to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:09.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那条推文和Minecraft毫无关系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:09.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}That tweet didn’t have anything to do with Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:11.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但不知怎么地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.57,0:07:11.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But through some miracle,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:13.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在他发出这条推文三天后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:13.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}three days after he posted this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他收到了回复邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:14.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}he got his email back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:16.29,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}好吧 现在我糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:16.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Okay, well now I’m confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:22.09,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}要么 A 他们真的花了整整两周才想明白怎么回复这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:22.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Either, A, it genuinely took them two entire weeks to figure out how to respond to this guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:26.61,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}……要么 B 这条措辞糟糕的推文不知为何引起了Notch的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:26.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}…or two, this poorly worded tweet got Notch’s attention for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}两者对我来说都难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Both of them seem unbelievable to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:30.74,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但其中一种必定是事情的真相
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.95,0:07:30.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But one of them had to be what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:33.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为不知怎么的 这个来自芬兰的普通大学生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.74,0:07:33.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because, somehow now, this random college student from Finland
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:36.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}现在正在和Mojang的首席执行官通Skype电话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:36.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}is on a Skype call with the CEO of Mojang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:39.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri告诉Carl Manneh 凭借在SciFest的经验
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:39.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri told Carl Manneh that with the SciFest experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:42.64,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他将是制作Minecraft教育版的理想人选
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:42.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}he would be a prime candidate to make an educational version of Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:45.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你知道的 如果他们想涉足这方面的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:45.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You know, if they ever wanted to get into that or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:47.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但要实现这一点 他需要他们的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:47.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But to do it, he would need their support.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:51.16,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}鉴于学校是长期增长的巨大市场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:51.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Given that schools are a huge place for long-term growth,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:53.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他没花多久就答应了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:53.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it didn’t take him long to say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:55.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在那之后 一切就飞速开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:55.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And after that, it was off to the races.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:57.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}首先他雇佣了Aleksi Postari
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:57.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}First he hired Aleksi Postari,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}一位东芬兰大学的本科生同学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}a fellow undergrad at UEF.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:00.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他学的也是教育专业
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:00.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}He’s also in education,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.91,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他比Santeri更懂编程
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but he knows a lot more about coding than Santeri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:05.65,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以Aleksi才是真正写模组代码的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:05.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So Aleksi would be the one actually coding the mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:06.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}策略是：
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:06.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The strategy is:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:07.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果东西没坏 那就……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:07.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}if it ain’t broke, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我的意思是 那就继续做你正在做的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I mean, just keep on doing what you’re doing then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:11.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它应该还是Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:11.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It should still be Minecraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:14.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只是加上一点教育元素
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:14.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but just with a little bit of education on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:15.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们就是这么起的名
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:15.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And that’s how they named it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:18.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}没人想玩一个为了教育而降低难度的Minecraft版本
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:18.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Nobody wants to play a dumbed-down version of Minecraft for education.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:20.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你能想象那种东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:20.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Can you even imagine such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:22.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}主要的修改应该面向老师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:22.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The main modification should be for the teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:24.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}给他们那种“造物特性”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:24.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Give them the creature– f-feature,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.06,0:08:25.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}管我之前怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.06,0:08:25.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}whatever I said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:28.09,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们不需要游戏内置任何课程
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:28.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They didn’t need any kind of lessons to be built into the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:31.61,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}课程应该由老师为每个具体班级量身制作
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:31.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They should be made for each specific class by the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不要恼人的标准化
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}No pesky standardization,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:34.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}要个性化
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:34.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but personalization.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:37.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有谁比任课老师更了解学生呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:37.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Who knows the students better than their own instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:41.16,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}实现这一点的最佳方式是制作一个客户端模组
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:41.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The best way to allow this was to make a client-side mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它非常便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It was super cheap,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:46.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且赋予他们很大能力 基本上可以对游戏为所欲为
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.40,0:08:46.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and it gave them a lot of power to basically do whatever they wanted to the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:47.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Aleksi负责编写模组代码
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:47.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Aleksi would code up the mod
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:50.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而Santeri负责商业方面的事务
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:50.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}while Santeri was working on the business side of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:53.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}理论上 他们俩就能撑起整个公司
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:53.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And in theory, these two could just be the business,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:55.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他们有一个小问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:55.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but they have a small problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:58.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}或者说……问题就在于他们太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:58.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Or… the problem is that they’re small.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:09:00.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}没人知道他们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:09:00.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Nobody knows who the heck they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:04.61,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们公司至今的全部履历 就是在自己学校的集会上展出
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:04.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Their entire company history so far is exhibiting at their own school’s convention
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:06.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}以及在Facebook上获得四个赞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.61,0:09:06.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and getting four likes on Facebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们需要触达更多人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They need to reach more people,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:10.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他们俩主要说芬兰语
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:10.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but they both mainly speak Finnish,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:12.91,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这让他们与庞大的Minecraft受众群隔绝开来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:12.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}cutting them off from the gigantic Minecraft audience
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那个正在英语世界形成的受众群
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that was being built in the English-speaking world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:17.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}天哪 要是有一位受欢迎的Minecraft教育者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Man, if only there was a popular Minecraft educator
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:20.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}母语是英语 而且他们能联系上就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.84,0:09:20.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}who natively spoke English that they could get in touch with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:24.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}镜头切到Joel Levin
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:24.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Cut to Joel Levin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:27.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他是纽约的一名教师 说服了上级
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}He’s a teacher in New York who convinced his higher-ups
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.69,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让他能在计算机课上使用Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to let him use Minecraft in his computer classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:33.65,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而他对学生和老师们对Minecraft的投入程度感到震惊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:33.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and he was shocked by how engaged the students and teachers were about Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:36.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}学生们可以学到使用计算机的一般原理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:36.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The students could learn the general principles of using computers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:40.17,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}比如打字、使用图形界面、以及可视化3D物体
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:40.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}like typing, using GUIs, and visualizing 3D objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:44.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}理论上 他们还能在同一时间学到许多其他学科的知识
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:44.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and in theory, they could be learning about a number of other subjects at the exact same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:47.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但与Santeri不同 Joel Levin会说英语
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:47.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But unlike Santeri, Joel Levin speaks English,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:48.77,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以当他写博客分享这件事时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:48.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so when he makes a blog about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:50.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}真的能上Reddit首页
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:50.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it actually gets to the Reddit front page.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:51.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这行就是这么运作的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:51.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}That’s just how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:54.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他成为了教育Minecraft的代表人物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:54.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And he becomes the face of educational Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.25,0:09:56.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他就是Twitter上的MinecraftTeachr
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.25,0:09:56.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}He’s the MinecraftTeachr on Twitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:58.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}没有字母E 因为他就是这么酷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.48,0:09:58.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Without the E because he’s cool like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:01.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他遇到了和Santeri类似的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:01.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But he ran into a similar problem as Santeri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:02.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}许多老师想试试这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:02.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Many teachers wanted to try this out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但它太让人困惑了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it was too confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:06.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他做了一个教程世界、一份模组清单
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:06.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}He made a tutorial world and a mod list
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:09.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还有很多博客文章 试图向人们解释这个过程
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:09.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and many blog posts trying to explain the process to people,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.57,0:10:13.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但要向一个只用过Acrobat和Yahoo的老师解释 实在是太难了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.57,0:10:13.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it’s really hard to explain to a teacher who has only ever used Acrobat and Yahoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦 而且这样的人有一百个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh, and there’s a hundred of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:16.64,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}要是某地有个人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.03,0:10:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If only someone, somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:19.19,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有着丰富的向学生介绍Minecraft的经验
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:19.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}had a lot of experience introducing Minecraft to students,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.19,0:10:22.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}正在寻找机会制作一个易安装的Minecraft教育模组
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.19,0:10:22.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and was looking to make a easy-to-install educational mod for Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:25.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且他们还需要一位有魅力的、受欢迎的英语母语者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:25.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and they also needed a popular charismatic native English speaker
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}来担任公司门面 把他们的理念传播得更远
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:27.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to be the face of the company to spread their message further.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:28.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果这样的公司存在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:28.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And if such a company existed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.99,0:10:30.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那会很酷 如果 比如……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.99,0:10:30.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it should be cool if, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:34.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我不知道 创始人突然莫名其妙地给他们发一条措辞糟糕的推文
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:34.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I don’t know, the founder just randomly sent them a poorly worded tweet out of the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:38.71,CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(949.333,735.667)}这是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:40.77,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们开了几次会 Santeri用他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:40.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They had a couple of meetings, and Santeri used his
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}神奇的魅惑之力说服了Joel Levin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}magical rizz powers to convince Joel Levin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:45.54,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}来他的公司担任教育总监
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:45.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to work at his company as the Education Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.81,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}虽然他的主要工作是公司的市场营销
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And while he mostly did marketing for the company,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:51.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他也是一位经验丰富的老师 知道老师们想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:51.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}he’s also a very experienced teacher who knows what they would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:54.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这个三人团队是他们新公司的真正核心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:54.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This team of three is the real core of their new company,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:55.29,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}TeacherGaming
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:55.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}TeacherGaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:56.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}一个词 因为他们就是这么酷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:56.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}One word, ’cause they’re cool like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:58.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我想这也不算新公司
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:58.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I guess it’s not a new company,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:01.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只是Santeri的辅导事业换了个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:01.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it’s Santeri’s tutoring venture with a different name,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他们的使命是新的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but their mission is new.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:03.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}当大多数老师在休假时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:03.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}While most teachers were on break,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:07.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们正争分夺秒 要在年底前成为一家真正的公司
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they were racing to become an actual business by the end of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:08.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们搭建了网站
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:08.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They set up a website,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}找了一位真正的平面设计师设计logo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:10.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}got an actual graphics designer for the logo,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:11.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:11.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}thank the fucking lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}然后开始着手做模组
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and then they got working on the mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:15.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且由于他们是直接与Mojang合作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:15.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And since they were working with Mojang directly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.85,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Jeb亲自给了TeacherGaming
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:17.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Jeb personally gave TeacherGaming
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:21.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}访问Minecraft全部源代码的权限
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:21.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}access to the entirety of the Minecraft source code.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:25.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这些年Minecraft在公开源代码方面慢慢有了进步
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:25.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft has slowly gotten better at revealing their source code over the years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:28.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但在当时 这是史无前例的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:28.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but at the time, this was unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:31.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这就好比我想稍微改一下可口可乐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:31.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is like if I wanted to slightly modify Coca-Cola
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:32.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}把它放进我的餐厅里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:32.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and put it in my restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:35.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}然后三个月后 他们把完整配方给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:35.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and then three months later they gave me the secret recipe in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:36.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:36.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:38.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们当时还没做完所有功能
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:38.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They didn’t have quite all of the features done yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但在2011年11月1日
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:40.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but on November 1st, 2011,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:43.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们以测试版的形式发布了MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:43.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they released MinecraftEdu as a beta test.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:44.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}接下来的几年里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:44.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The following years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:48.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Joel频繁出现在大量播客、电台节目和YouTube视频中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:48.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Joel would get featured on a ton of podcasts, radio shows, and YouTube videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:50.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他去了Minecon 2011
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:50.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}He went to Minecon 2011,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecon 2012
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecon 2012,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}甚至出现在官方Minecraft纪录片里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and was even in the official Minecraft documentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:55.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而在这整个过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:55.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And the whole time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:57.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他一直在推广这个名为  的全新模组
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:57.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}he would be promoting this brand new mod called
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:59.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:59.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}MinecraftEdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:02.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这是一个由教师设计的Minecraft替代版本
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s an alternate version of Minecraft designed by teachers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:05.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}供教师在校园环境中与学生一起使用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:05.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}for teachers to use in a school setting with students.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:07.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}学校用它来做各种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:07.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Schools are using it for everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}从历史
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}from history,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}到数学
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to math,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.07,0:12:11.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}到艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.07,0:12:11.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to art.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.05,0:12:13.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们可以访问我的网站minecraftedu.com
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.05,0:12:13.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Well, they can go to my website, minecraftedu.com,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:17.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们有一些入门材料
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:17.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and we have some materials to get started
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还有一些可以用这款游戏做的事情的创意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and some ideas for things you can do with the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:23.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} 所有这些媒体报道 说服了许多家长、教职员工和老师：
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:23.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} All of this media coverage would convince many parents, faculty, and teachers that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:25.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嘿 也许我们可以给Minecraft一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:25.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}hey, maybe we could give Minecraft a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.75,0:12:31.17,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}到2012年底 大约有1000所学校决定购买他们的Minecraft模组
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.75,0:12:31.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}By the end of 2012, around about 1,000 schools had decided to buy their Minecraft mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.51,0:12:32.65,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}等等 什么？等等 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.51,0:12:32.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Wait, what? Wait, sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:33.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}购  购买他们的Minecra
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:33.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}B- buy their Minecra
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:35.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“购买他们的Minecraft模组”是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:35.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What do you mean buy their Minecraft mo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:38.33,CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961.333,731.667)}出售？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.33,0:12:40.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}是的 就像To Pimp a Butterfly的第8首曲目一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.33,0:12:40.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Yes, much like track 8 on TPAB,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:41.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它是“待售”的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:41.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it is For Sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:42.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果你不知道的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:42.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If you don’t know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:44.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}截至本视频制作之时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:44.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}as of the making of this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:47.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft Java模组是不能用来卖钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.48,0:12:47.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft Java mods cannot be sold for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不过历史上只有一个例外
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:49.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There has only ever been one exception, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:51.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那就是MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:51.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and that is MinecraftEdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:55.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}要让这个模组进入你的教室 要花41美元
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:55.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It costs $41 to get this mod into your classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:58.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这可不便宜 但公平地说 它会持续更新
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}That’s a lot, but to be fair, it would get updated,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:01.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且整个学校只需要买一份
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:13:01.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and you only needed one of them for your entire school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:02.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但这一部分其实还算是便宜的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:02.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But that was actually the cheap part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:05.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}真正的花费在于你还得购买Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:05.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The real cost came in whenever you had to buy Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为……没错 当然啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Because… yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:08.61,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这只是一个Minecraft模组
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:08.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is just a Minecraft mod,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:10.17,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你仍然得买游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.61,0:13:10.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you’ve still got to buy the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:14.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Mojang还允许TeacherGaming以折扣价销售游戏本体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:14.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Mojang also allowed TeacherGaming to sell the actual game at a discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.55,0:13:17.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}没错 TeacherGaming还是历史上仅有的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.55,0:13:17.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}That’s right, TeacherGaming is also one of the only other
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:21.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}官方Minecraft: Java Edition在线零售商之一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:21.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}official online retailers of Minecraft: Java Edition ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:24.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我跟你说 Santeri简直就是天赋异禀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:24.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I’m telling you, Santeri is just fucking built different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:26.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}就是 他  什么都能办成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Like, it  he can get anything done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:27.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:27.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}世界上任何事！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Anything in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:31.00,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}游戏每份18美元
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:31.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It costs $18 per copy of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:36.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}或者……你可以花335美元买25份的捆绑包
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:36.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Or… you could get a bundle of 25 copies for $335,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:39.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}勉强达到五折优惠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:39.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}just barely getting it to a 50% discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但当然 如果你的学生已经有Minecraft了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But of course, if your students already own Minecraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:46.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们其实可以带上自己的个人账号 用它来省点钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:46.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they could actually just bring in their own personal account and use that to save some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:48.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我不知道该怎么好好算这笔账
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:48.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I don’t really know of a good way to account for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:51.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以从现在起我就假设老师得买下所有账号
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.60,0:13:51.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so from now on I’m just going to assume that the teacher has to buy all the accounts,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:52.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这样比较公平
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:52.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}just to be fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:58.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那么 要让MinecraftEdu进入你那个有18到25名学生的教室 总花费
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:58.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So, grand total for getting MinecraftEdu into your classroom of 18 to 25 students,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:01.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}是376美元
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:01.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it would cost $376.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:05.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}老师们通常每年自掏腰包超过500美元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:05.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Teachers already usually spend over $500
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:07.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}划掉 实际上是900美元
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:07.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Uh, scratch that, actually $900
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:10.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}花在教室上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:10.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}per year out of pocket on their classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:14.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}正因如此 很多老师不得不说服上级为他们购买
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:14.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Because of this, a lot of teachers had to convince their higher-ups to buy it for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:15.91,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}对像Joel Levin这样的人来说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:15.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}For someone like Joel Levin,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:18.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他在曼哈顿一所前卫的预科学校工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:18.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}who works at a progressive prep school in Manhattan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:19.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这很容易
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:19.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}this was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:22.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}每个学生每年要交数万美元的学费才能来这里上学
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:22.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Each student pays tens of thousands of dollars a year to go here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:26.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以他们当然买得起一份Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.99,0:14:26.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so you’re damn right they can buy a copy of Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.25,0:14:28.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但如果你不在曼哈顿的私立学校
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.25,0:14:28.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But if you aren’t at a private school in Manhattan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:32.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那么连试一下都会增加整整一层的阻力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:32.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it adds a whole other layer of friction to even testing this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:35.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}研讨会上很多问题都是关于这个问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:35.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Many of the questions at the panels were about this exact problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:38.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}当然 “让老师决定它用来做什么”这一点挺讨喜的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:38.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Sure, the thing where teachers decide what it’s used for is cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:40.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但这并不能打动那些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:40.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but that doesn’t exactly inspire the staff
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:44.97,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在考虑掏钱之前要求先看课程大纲的校方人员
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:44.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that demand to see a curriculum before they even think about opening their wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.97,0:14:48.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但提供课程大纲与他们的整个项目理念相悖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.97,0:14:48.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But having a curriculum was against the whole philosophy of their program.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:50.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们想要颠覆学校
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:50.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They were trying to shake up schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:53.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以他们实在没法给出令人满意的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:53.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so they couldn’t really give them a satisfying answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:55.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}就算你真的过五关斩六将
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:55.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And even if you do jump through all the hoops,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:58.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}花了这么多时间和金钱 你也不过是买了个Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:58.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}for all of this time and money, you’ve just bought Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:01.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你仍然需要真正地制作课程
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:15:01.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you still need to actually make the lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:01.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:04.98,CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1005.333,691.667)}值得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:07.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}好吧 我们不必只看着wiki纸上谈兵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:07.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Well, we don’t have to just look at the wiki and theorize,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们仍然可以安装MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:09.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}we can still install MinecraftEdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:13.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}整个系统被专门设计成这样：学校一旦下载了它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:13.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The whole system was specifically designed so that once schools downloaded it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}运行它就不需要联网了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they didn’t need an internet connection to run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只需要所有人都连在同一个网络里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They just needed to all be on the same network.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:20.74,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们有一个特殊的启动器来安装MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:20.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They have this special launcher to install MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:23.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它在发布十年后仍然能用
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:23.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that still works a decade after it was released,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:24.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这真的很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.47,0:15:24.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which is really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:28.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}登录后 你可以选择名字、性别、装扮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:28.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}After you log in, you pick your name, gender, outfit,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:31.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还可以输入一个秘密代码变成教师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:31.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and you can put in a secret code to become a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:33.77,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我把代码设置成了“点赞订阅”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:33.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I set the code to like and subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:36.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这个游戏启动器还兼作服务器启动器
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:36.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The game launcher also doubles as a server launcher,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:38.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}真是相当漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:38.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which is pretty frickin’ slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:41.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只要开启服务器 学生们就能通过局域网加入
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:41.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Just turn on the server and the students can join through LAN.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:42.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}看看这个 他们还放了一个方便的按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And look at that, they include a convenient button
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:48.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}用来加载Joel Levin早在2011年做的教程世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:48.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to load Joel Levin’s tutorial world from all the way back in 2011.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:49.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:49.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Let’s go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:51.15,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}没错 就是它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:51.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Yep, this is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:52.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们有一个专门的教师区域
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.15,0:15:52.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They have this special teacher section,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在这里可以看到所有新方块
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and we can see all the new blocks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:56.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}其中很多只是限制学生能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:56.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Many of them just restrict what the students can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:59.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}比如允许建造方块和禁止建造方块
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:59.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}like the build allow block and disallow block,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:03.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这可能是我这辈子见过最烂的贴图 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:03.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which may be some of the worst textures that I have ever seen, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:04.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只是想提醒你一下 呃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:04.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Just want to remind you that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:07.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}顺便说一句 这是官方认可的Mojang产品
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:07.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}this is an official Mojang-approved product, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:10.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我想它跟很多老的程序员风格美术挺搭的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:10.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It fits with a lot of the old programmer art, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:12.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}糟糕的贴图一直延续到这些边界方块上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:12.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And the terrible textures continue onto these border blocks
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:16.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它们防止学生一路跑到天空上限
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:16.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that prevent students from crossing all the way up to the sky limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:19.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还有传送方块 可以轻松移动学生
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:19.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}We also get teleporter blocks to move students around easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:21.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它们的工作原理基本上和Waystones模组一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:21.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They basically work like the Waystones mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:22.97,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为这是为学校准备的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:22.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Because this is for school,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.97,0:16:25.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}传达信息非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.97,0:16:25.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}relaying information is super important.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:27.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但告示牌放不下那么多文字
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:27.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But signs don’t really hold that much text,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:30.09,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以自然的解决方案当然是……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:30.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so the natural solution is of course…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:32.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}宽告示牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:32.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}wide sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:34.64,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这些东西真的在真实模组里我没开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}These are actually in the real mod. I’m not joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们真的只是把告示牌拉宽了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They literally just stretched a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:39.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还有这些Slenderman书页 上面可以放海量文字
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:39.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There are also these Slenderman pages that can hold tons of text on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:43.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}以及大大的“i”方块 用来标示信息所在的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:43.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and big “i” blocks to show you where information is located.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这里有个视频 一名学生在焚烧一整立方体的它们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Here’s a video of a student burning a gigantic cube of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还有一堆数字方块
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There’s also a bunch of these number blocks that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:50.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我猜是给数学课用的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:50.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I guess are supposed to be used for math.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:53.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不错 但它只局限于前代数
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:53.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Cool, but it’s kind of limited to pre-algebra,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:54.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为没有变量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:54.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because there aren’t any variables.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}大概可以拿一个方块当变量用吧 我猜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Kinda use a block as a variable, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:59.19,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}玩家们 来解方程组吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:59.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Solve the system of equations, gamers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:02.19,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}怎么了？这个视频讲的是学校 所以你有家庭作业
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:02.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What? This video’s about school, so you get homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:04.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}周一上课前交 赶紧去写
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:04.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s due before class on Monday, get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}以上就是所有新增的方块
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:06.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Those are all of the block additions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嘿嘿 看到我玩的小把戏了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Heh, see what I did there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但对老师们来说 还有更多可看的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But there’s a lot more to see for the teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有一套完整的教师控制图形界面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There’s a GUI for a whole set of teacher controls,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:14.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这样他们就不必输入命令了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:14.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so they don’t have to type out commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:18.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}其中有些功能甚至比基础游戏更早加入MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:18.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And a couple of these were added to MinecraftEdu before they even made it into the base game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:21.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}从这里你还可以冻结游戏、禁止学生建造、
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:21.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}From here you could also freeze the game, disable student building,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:25.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}布置作业、把所有人传送到出生点、静音所有学生、给所有学生发物品
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:25.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}add assignments, teleport everyone to spawn, mute all students, give all students items,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.68,0:17:26.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}等等等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.68,0:17:26.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:29.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}老师们还可以使用一套建造工具
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:29.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Teachers also have access to a suite of building tools
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:31.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}一次性放置或移除大量方块
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:31.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to place or remove tons of blocks at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:33.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}既然不能把WorldEdit给老师们用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:33.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Since they couldn’t give WorldEdit to teachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.93,0:17:36.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们只好重制其中最重要的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.93,0:17:36.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they needed to remake the most important parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:40.51,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这玩意儿怎么还是比现在Minecraft里的/fill命令好用？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:40.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}How is this still better than the /fill command in current Minecraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:41.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.52,0:17:41.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.57,0:17:45.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}就MinecraftEdu模组本身而言 就这些了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.57,0:17:45.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And as far as the MinecraftEdu mod is concerned, that’s it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:48.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}进去用这些工具制作你自己的课程吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Go in and use these tools to make your own lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:50.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为这个模组不附带任何课程
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:50.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Because there are no lessons that come with this mod,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:52.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你必须全部自己做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:52.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you have to make all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:54.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}MinecraftEdu的前期成本真的很高
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:54.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}MinecraftEdu is really expensive up front,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:56.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}无论是时间还是金钱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:56.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}both in terms of time and money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.71,0:17:58.09,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}就算你有WorldEdit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.71,0:17:58.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Even if you have WorldEdit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:17:59.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}做起来还是要花不少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.09,0:17:59.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it still takes a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:01.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且不是每个老师都是游戏设计师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:01.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and not every teacher is a game designer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:05.61,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们不可能每天都坚持做 实在是太花时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:05.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They can’t possibly do it every single day consistently, it just takes too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:08.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且除此之外 还要近400美元
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:08.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And then on top of that, it’s nearly $400.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:10.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}就算你闯过所有这些难关
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.45,0:18:10.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And even if you jump through all of these hoops,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你仍然需要浪费好几节课来讲解它
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you still need to waste multiple classes explaining it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:14.79,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你需要一群好老师
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:14.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You need a bunch of good teachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:18.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且你需要用特定的方式来教学 它才能真正起作用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.80,0:18:18.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and you need to teach in a specific way for it to actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.07,0:18:20.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它的定价好像它能取代你整个教室
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.07,0:18:20.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s priced as though it will replace your entire classroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但实际上要做到这一点太花时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but in practice it takes too much time to actually do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:25.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在完整发布MinecraftEdu之后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:25.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}After releasing MinecraftEdu fully,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.99,0:18:27.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们陷入了困境
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.99,0:18:27.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they were in a predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:30.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们想添加更多内容让产品更值
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.27,0:18:30.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They wanted to add more content to make it more worth it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:33.11,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但那会让本已高昂的价格更高
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:33.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but that would increase the price higher than it already is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:36.82,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}怎样才能在不花大钱的情况下 为客户提供更多价值呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:36.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}How do you provide more value to your customers without spending a bunch of money?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.81,0:18:39.88,CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1000,830.333)}让社区来做！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:43.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}2013年底 Teacher Gaming发布了MinecraftEdu世界库
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:43.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}In late 2013, Teacher Gaming released the MinecraftEdu World Library.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:47.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这是一个网站 老师们可以在上面上传自己的世界供他人使用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:47.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This was a website where teachers could upload their own worlds for others to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:51.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}运营三年后 它总共只有172个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:51.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}After three years of uptime, it had a grand total of 172 worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:54.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在同一时期 PlanetMinecraft上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:54.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}During that same timeframe on PlanetMinecraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:55.61,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}148
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:55.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}148
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:57.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}千张地图被上传
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:57.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}thousand maps were uploaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:19:00.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那172张地图中 有多少是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:19:00.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}How many of those 172 maps are the exact
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:03.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}恰好符合你课堂的科目、课程大纲和教学风格？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:03.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}subject, curriculum, and teaching style for your classroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:04.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}没有那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:04.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Not that many.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:07.61,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但它们通过大部分世界质量不错来弥补这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:07.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But they make up for it by most of the worlds being pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:11.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}像乘法竞速、Minecraft妙探寻凶、绵羊概率、
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.61,0:19:11.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Worlds like Multiplication Race, Minecraft Clue, Sheep Probability,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:14.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}人文世界和动物细胞之旅都是这份列表中的亮点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:14.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The World of Humanities, and Animal Cell Tour are highlights on this list.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:17.69,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}当然 里面也有不少模板世界
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:17.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Sure, there’s your fair share of just, like, template worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还有一些明显是学生上传的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:19.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and ones that were clearly uploaded by a student,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:22.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但总体来说 质量相当稳定地高
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:22.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but overall, it’s pretty consistently high quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:23.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果你在这里上传世界
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:23.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If you uploaded here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:26.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那你真的很在乎其他老师能不能从中获得一堂好课
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:26.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you actually cared about other teachers getting a good lesson out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:29.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不像本视频后面会提到的某些其他库
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:29.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Unlike some other libraries that will be mentioned later in this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}本着让社区帮忙的这一思路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}In this vein of getting the community to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们还有一个谷歌群组
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they also had a Google Group.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.43,0:19:35.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我以前从没听说过谷歌群组
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.43,0:19:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I’ve never heard of a Google Group before,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.69,0:19:38.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但它基本上就是一个群组、邮件、论坛……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.69,0:19:38.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it’s basically like a group, email, forum…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:41.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}以及其他一些莫名其妙的互联网词汇缝合怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:41.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}other unc internet-type word abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:44.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这个群组里大约有3600人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:44.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There are about 3600 people in this group,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:47.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且里面似乎有很多人愿意帮助别人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:47.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and it seems like there’s a lot of people ready to help others out in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.53,0:19:49.94,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这真的非常棒 而且是免费的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.53,0:19:49.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is genuinely really cool, and it was free.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:53.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我提到这个群组 是因为在MinecraftEdu最初的公告帖中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:53.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I mention this group because in the initial announcement post for MinecraftEdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:59.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们说要为你和你的同事提供现场研讨会和在职培训
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:57.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they said that they would offer on-site workshops and in-service training
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:59.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}for you and your colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但据我所知
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}As far as I can tell though,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:02.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这从来没有真正发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:02.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}this never actually happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.23,0:20:06.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0\fs 70}我的游戏理论猜测是 这个谷歌群组是在技术上实现这一点的一种更省钱的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.23,0:20:06.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}My Game Theory is that this Google Group was a cheaper way to technically do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:09.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}连同他们自己的个人wiki
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:09.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}along with their own personal wiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:10.65,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}本频道很爱wiki
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:10.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}We love wikis on this channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:13.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它们是让社区团结起来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They’re a great way for the community to band together
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}传播经过同行评审的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to spread peer-reviewed information.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:16.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让我们来看看 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:16.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Let’s check it out, and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:20.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦 你必须经过个人审批才能编辑这个wiki
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:20.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh, you have to be personally approved to edit this wiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.59,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以社区其实根本帮不上忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So the community can’t really help at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:25.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为Joel Levin显然害怕被恶意破坏？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:25.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because Joel Levin is apparently scared of vandalism?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:28.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}拜托 开放编辑才是wiki变好的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:28.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Girl, it being open is how the wiki gets better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:30.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这就是人们贡献的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:30.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}That’s, like, why people contribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.03,0:20:31.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且 它根本就不是MediaWiki
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.03,0:20:31.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Also, it’s not a MediaWiki at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:33.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只是一些专有软件
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:33.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it’s just some proprietary software.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:36.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且那些页面的排版也完全不像wiki条目
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:36.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And the pages aren’t really formatted like wiki articles at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:38.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}更像是FAQ（常见问题解答）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:38.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they’re more like a FAQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:39.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这个wiki一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:39.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This wiki’s a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Joel 你觉得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What do you think about it, Joel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:43.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} 但我要说句大实话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:43.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} But I’ll be brutally honest here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:45.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我个人认为这个wiki一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:45.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I personally think the wiki’s a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:46.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} 是的 没错 它很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} Yeah, no, it’s not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:48.81,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}问题的一大来源是服务器方面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:48.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}One big source of issues was the server aspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:51.77,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不是所有老师都恰好是网络专家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:51.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Not all teachers just so happen to be networking experts,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}即便对专家来说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and even for someone who is,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.43,0:20:56.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它有时候也会随机地决定不想工作
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.43,0:20:56.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it just randomly decides that it doesn’t want to work sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:58.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哪怕是在拍相关视频的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:58.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}even while filming a video about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:01.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}要是能花钱请别人来替我处理服务器问题就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If only I could pay someone else to deal with the server issues instead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:04.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}隆重推出MinecraftEdu托管服务！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Introducing the MinecraftEdu hosting service!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:06.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}每月只需一张Andrew Jackson（20美元）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:06.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}For one Andrew Jackson per month,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:10.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你就能租一台托管MinecraftEdu的Minecraft服务器
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.62,0:21:10.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you could rent a Minecraft server that would host MinecraftEdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:12.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它永远在线 会备份你的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:12.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It would always be online, back up your worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并把它们全部存储起来以便快速切换
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and store them all for quick switching.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:17.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但在你刚付的那些钱之上 它还是太贵了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:17.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But it is so expensive on top of the amount you just paid,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.57,0:21:18.81,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有点离谱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.57,0:21:18.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it’s kind of insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:20.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}自然而然 2016年 他们下调了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:20.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Naturally, in 2016, they lowered
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.99,0:21:22.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}抱歉 我的意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.99,0:21:22.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}sorry, I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:25.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们把价格上调了一张Abraham Lincoln（5美元）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:25.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}raised the price by adding Abraham Lincoln into the equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}行吧 挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Cool, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:30.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}为了让交易更诱人 他们还增加了一项：模组支持
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.63,0:21:30.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}One more extra that was added to sweeten the deal was modding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:32.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}MinecraftEdu发布时Forge还没流行起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:32.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}MinecraftEdu came out before Forge was popular,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.57,0:21:36.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以当他们确定Forge不是一时热潮后 模组不得不迁移过去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.57,0:21:36.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so the mod had to be moved over there once they knew that Forge was not just a fad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:40.94,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以现在你可以在MinecraftEdu旁边安装任何其他Forge模组
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:40.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So now you can install any other Forge mod alongside MinecraftEdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:42.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们还内置了一个完整的模组管理器
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:42.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And they built in a whole mod manager
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:45.64,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}可以在里面启用或禁用已安装的模组
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:45.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}where you could enable and disable the mods that you had installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:47.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}除此之外 Teacher Gaming还制作了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:47.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}On top of this, Teacher Gaming also created
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:51.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}针对特定科目的自定附加模组
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:51.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}their own custom additional mods for certain subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:54.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}ComputerCraft模组是由Daniel Ratcliffe制作的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:54.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The mod ComputerCraft was made by Daniel Ratcliffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:55.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不 不是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:55.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}No, not that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:56.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}dan200
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:56.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}dan200.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:58.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他参与过Kinectimals的开发 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:58.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}He worked on Kinectimals, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:21:59.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}对他的名字放尊重点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:21:59.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Put some respect on his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.75,0:22:03.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这个模组让你可以给这些海龟编程 让它们做任何你想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.75,0:22:03.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is the mod that lets you code these little turtles to do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:05.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它出了名的看起来超酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:05.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s famous for looking super cool
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:07.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}然后又让孩子们哭出来 因为
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:07.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and then making kids cry because,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.13,0:22:09.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哎呀 你没法凭空就会用Lua编程
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.13,0:22:09.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}aw, you can’t magically code in Lua,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:10.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你***白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you fucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.89,0:22:13.00,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦 好吧 看来你就是个废物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.89,0:22:13.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh, well, I guess you’re a fucking failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:13.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}****
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:13.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.18,0:22:16.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不是说我自己经历过这些
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.18,0:22:16.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Not that I’ve experienced that or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.25,0:22:19.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}幸运的是 ComputerCraftEdu试图解决这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.25,0:22:19.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Luckily, ComputerCraftEdu tries to fix this problem
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:24.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它新增了一只新手海龟 可以用拖拽式编程语言来编程
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}by adding a new beginner turtle that you can program with a drag-and-drop coding language.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:26.54,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}听起来很酷 直到你看到它并开始想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:26.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Sounds cool until you look at it and start to think,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:28.85,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}也许用Lua编程其实也没那么糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:28.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}maybe coding in Lua isn’t that bad, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:31.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你可以给海龟添加小装饰和名字
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:31.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You can add little cosmetics and names to the turtles,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:33.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它们绝对萌翻了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:33.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which are absolutely adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.38,0:22:35.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}她叫Denise 也许看起来平平无奇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.38,0:22:35.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Her name is Denise, and she may look basic,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:38.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但她的内部构造复杂得惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.71,0:22:38.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but she is insanely complicated on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.47,0:22:40.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不过 这还不是唯一的附加模组
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.47,0:22:40.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This wasn’t the only extra mod, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.22,0:22:44.01,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}TeacherGaming和dan200合作制作了一个模组 与……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.22,0:22:44.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}TeacherGaming and dan200 collaborated on making a mod with,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:45.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:45.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:47.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}加州理工和谷歌？？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:47.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}California Tech and Google??
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:48.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哇 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:48.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Wow, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:49.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它叫qCraft
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:49.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s called qCraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:52.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft太棒了 量子物理称霸！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.99,0:22:52.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft rocks, quantum rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.47,0:22:55.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它加入了一些模糊模拟量子力学的方块
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.47,0:22:55.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It adds blocks that vaguely resemble quantum mechanics
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:57.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在你观察它们时发生变化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:57.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}by changing when you observe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:23:00.16,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这是个可以拿来向别人炫耀的酷模组 好说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:23:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s a cool mod to be able to show off to people to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:04.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哇 你能相信我的二年级学生正在通过Minecraft学习量子物理吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}wow, can you believe that my second-graders are learning quantum physics through Minecraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.32,0:23:06.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这真是太有教育意义、太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.32,0:23:06.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is so educational and amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:09.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但归根结底 它更像是一种“我们做到了”的噱头
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:09.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Ultimately, though, it kind of just feels like a gimmick to say that they did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:12.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而不是真正能帮助老师和学生的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:12.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}rather than anything that actually helps teachers or students.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:15.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我觉得有些其他游戏在量子物理方面做得比这好得多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I think that some other games have done quantum much better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:17.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且 呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:17.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.36,0:23:18.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我重  我喜欢这个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.36,0:23:18.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I re– I like this joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:20.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我希望你们能体会到为了这个我准备了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I hope you acknowledge how long this took me to set up,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:22.29,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但它解析起来太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:22.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it takes a bit too long to resolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.29,0:23:24.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以我只是在拖时间……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.29,0:23:24.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so I’m just kind of stalling…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:25.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}好了 行 搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:25.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Okay, cool, we’re done.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.89,0:23:27.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}和ComputerCraftEdu不同
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.89,0:23:27.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Unlike ComputerCraftEdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.33,0:23:29.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们不能把这个和主模组捆绑在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.33,0:23:29.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they couldn’t bundle this with the main mod,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.57,0:23:32.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而只是把它放在网站上供手动安装
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.57,0:23:32.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and instead just put it on their website to install manually.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:36.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我真想知道为什么Mojang不愿意和谷歌合作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:36.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I sure do wonder why Mojang was trying not to work with Google.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:38.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嗯 我不知道 真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Hmm, I don’t know, weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.39,0:23:41.11,CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\pos(948,618.333)}好的 我现在完成了这个过渡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:43.29,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而就模组周边的一切而言
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.12,0:23:43.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And as far as everything surrounding the mod goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.29,0:23:44.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}也就这些了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.29,0:23:44.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that is finally it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.53,0:23:45.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那它现在值得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.53,0:23:45.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Is it worth it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.30,0:23:47.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嗯 对很多学校来说 答案是肯定的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.30,0:23:47.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Well, for a lot of schools, the answer was yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.42,0:23:49.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} 你好 我叫Santeri Koivisto
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.42,0:23:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} Hello, my name is Santeri Koivisto,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.28,0:23:50.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我是TeacherGaming的首席执行官
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.28,0:23:50.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I’m the CEO of TeacherGaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.75,0:23:54.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们现在与40个国家的6000多所学校合作
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.75,0:23:54.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}We now work with over 6,000 schools in 40 different countries,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:59.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们喜欢称自己是教育领域的变革推动者之一
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:59.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and we like to call ourselves one of the changemakers in the educational field.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:03.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} 但是 当你主动违背学校的常规运作方式时
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:03.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} But, when you’re actively going against how schools normally operate,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:04.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}大多数学校只会拒绝你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:04.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}most schools will just reject you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.96,0:24:07.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}老师们多年来一直要求某种课程大纲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.96,0:24:07.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Teachers asked for years for some kind of curriculum
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.67,0:24:10.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}或者能实时追踪学生行为的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.67,0:24:10.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}or ways to track what their students are doing as they’re doing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.63,0:24:12.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他们真的给不了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.63,0:24:12.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but they literally couldn’t give it to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.25,0:24:14.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为他们想当变革推动者
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.25,0:24:14.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because they wanted to be the changemakers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.24,0:24:15.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这不是学校
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.24,0:24:15.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This isn’t school,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.03,0:24:16.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们活在社会中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.03,0:24:16.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}we’re living in a society.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.31,0:24:19.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}许多老师要求支持其他设备 而不只是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.31,0:24:19.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Many teachers asked for support for devices other than just
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:20.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}PC、Mac和Linux
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:20.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}PC, Mac, and Linux,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:24.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}比如教室里越来越流行的Chromebook和iPad
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:24.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}like the increasingly popular Chromebooks and iPads in classrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.25,0:24:25.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他们做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.25,0:24:25.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But they couldn’t do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.39,0:24:27.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为这个模组是基于Java版构建的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.39,0:24:27.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because this mod was built off of Java Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:29.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所有这些人都立刻被排除在外了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:29.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}All those people were just instantly cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.78,0:24:33.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这些是他们战略中固有的问题 会阻碍大规模采用
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.78,0:24:33.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}These were innate problems with their strategy that would prevent mass adoption.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:36.29,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这意味着这基本上只会是一个噱头
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.72,0:24:36.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Which means that this would basically just be a gimmick,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:38.94,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而不是什么教育革命
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:38.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}rather than some kind of educational revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.94,0:24:40.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果他们能从头再来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.94,0:24:40.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If they could restart from scratch,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.45,0:24:42.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们可能会做得大不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.45,0:24:42.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they would probably do things pretty differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.57,0:24:45.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有一家公司一直在暗处观察
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.57,0:24:45.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And there’s one company that’s been watching from the shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.31,0:24:47.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并且认为他们知道该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.31,0:24:47.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and thinks that they know how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:50.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而他们的计划始于那个2014年9月的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:50.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And their plan starts with the huge, earth-shattering,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.06,0:24:53.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}被我一带而过的惊天动地的大事件
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.06,0:24:53.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}gigantic event in September of 2014 that I skimmed over:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:57.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}TeacherGaming参加ALS冰桶挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:57.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}TeacherGaming doing the ALS Ice Bucket Challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:25:00.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有趣的是 他们的视频里没有冰
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:25:00.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Funnily enough, their video doesn’t contain ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:01.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}也没有桶
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.73,0:25:01.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Or a bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:03.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦 而且第二天
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.50,0:25:03.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh, and the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.02,0:25:05.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}微软宣布要收购Mojang
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.02,0:25:05.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Microsoft announced that they were going to buy Mojang.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.67,0:25:07.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri知道他们需要多元化发展
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.67,0:25:07.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri knew that they needed to diversify,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.95,0:25:10.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他们觉得船到桥头自然直
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.95,0:25:10.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but they figured that they would just cross that bridge when they came to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.87,0:25:11.59,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}随便吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.87,0:25:11.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.59,0:25:12.77,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}呃 好吧 它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.59,0:25:12.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Uh, well, it’s here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.77,0:25:14.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}当然 眼下它其实影响不到他们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.77,0:25:14.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Sure, right now it doesn’t really affect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:16.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他们的协议怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:16.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But what about their agreement?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.41,0:25:19.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果收购成真 Minecraft的未来会变成什么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.41,0:25:19.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}How is Minecraft going to look in the future if this happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.13,0:25:23.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}微软还会那么愿意让TeacherGaming查看Minecraft源代码吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.13,0:25:23.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Will Microsoft be as willing to let TeacherGaming look at the Minecraft source code?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.44,0:25:24.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}或者卖他们的模组？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.44,0:25:24.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Or sell their mod?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.67,0:25:26.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}或者卖Minecraft本体？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.67,0:25:26.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Or sell Minecraft itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.43,0:25:28.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果Minecraft就这么消亡了会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.43,0:25:28.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What would happen if Minecraft just died out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.86,0:25:31.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它的人气开始下滑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.86,0:25:31.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Its popularity was starting to fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.10,0:25:33.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且它即将归微软所有
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.10,0:25:33.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and it’s about to be owned by Microsoft,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.47,0:25:35.04,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那个万物杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.47,0:25:35.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}the killers of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:39.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有传言说将有一个新版本的Minecraft完全取代Java版
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:39.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There are rumors of a new version of Minecraft that would replace Java Edition entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:40.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果它消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:40.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And if it goes away,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:42.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那他们到底该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:42.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}then what the heck are they going to even do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.26,0:25:43.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦不
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.26,0:25:43.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.32,0:25:44.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}看看他们的产品组合
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.32,0:25:44.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Looking at their portfolio,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.75,0:25:47.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们有MinecraftEdu以及与之相关的所有东西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.75,0:25:47.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they have MinecraftEdu and all the things that go along with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.98,0:25:51.54,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们还有一个坎巴拉太空计划的教育版 叫做
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.98,0:25:51.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they’ve got an educational version of Kerbal Space Program called
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.54,0:25:52.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}说出来你都不信
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.54,0:25:52.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and you’re not going to believe this
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:53.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}KerbalEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:53.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}KerbalEdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.88,0:25:55.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}然后……就没了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.88,0:25:55.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and… that’s it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.02,0:25:57.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果明天Minecraft死了 他们就完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.02,0:25:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If Minecraft dies tomorrow, they’re fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.44,0:26:00.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们刚被一桶“冰”水浇脸 猛然惊醒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.44,0:26:00.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They just took an ALS ice bucket to the face and woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.71,0:26:02.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们必须多元化
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.71,0:26:02.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They need to diversify.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.06,0:26:03.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}最好是昨天就开始
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.06,0:26:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Like, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.20,0:26:04.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们打算怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.20,0:26:04.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}How are they going to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.40,0:26:05.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嗯 要回答这个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.40,0:26:05.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Well, to answer that question,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.95,0:26:07.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri必须回到他的初心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.95,0:26:07.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Santeri had to go back to his roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.76,0:26:11.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}2011年3月 Santeri在自己的个人博客上写道
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.76,0:26:11.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}In March of 2011, Santeri wrote on his own personal blog that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.02,0:26:13.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“如果我是软件公司的老板”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.02,0:26:13.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“if I were the boss of a software company”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.10,0:26:14.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他现在确实是了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.10,0:26:14.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which he is now
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.26,0:26:18.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“下一个项目将是一个全面的电子‘学习与教学环境’
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.26,0:26:18.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“the next project would be a comprehensive electronic ‘learning and teaching environment’
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.31,0:26:22.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}把老师们日常生活中的所有零散部分和管理整合起来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.31,0:26:22.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which would include all the scattered pieces and management of the daily lives of teachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.35,0:26:23.69,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}全部装进一扇门里”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.35,0:26:23.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}all into one door.”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.69,0:26:25.51,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}然后还有什么关于“金色雨”的东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.69,0:26:25.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And then something about golden showers?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.51,0:26:26.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我不知道那
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.51,0:26:26.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I don’t know wh– it’s
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.71,0:26:27.97,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}管他呢 呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.71,0:26:27.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Whatever. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.97,0:26:29.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这不是什么好选择
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.97,0:26:29.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It wasn’t a great option,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.43,0:26:32.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但这是他们避免落得两手空空的最佳机会
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.43,0:26:32.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but this was their best chance to not be left holding the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.60,0:26:35.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}TeacherGaming的创始人们很快创办了一家新公司
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.60,0:26:35.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The creators of TeacherGaming quickly founded a new company,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.18,0:26:36.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}再多五分钟有限公司
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.18,0:26:36.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Five More Minutes Limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.55,0:26:37.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这个名字放在这儿真是恰如其分
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.55,0:26:37.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The name really fits here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.72,0:26:41.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们的目标是制作一款名为TeacherGaming Desk的新桌面应用
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.72,0:26:41.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Their goal is to make a new desktop app called TeacherGaming Desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.33,0:26:43.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们联系了一堆游戏公司
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.33,0:26:43.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They contacted a bunch of gaming companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.05,0:26:45.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并利用他们在MinecraftEdu上的影响力
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.05,0:26:45.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and using their clout with MinecraftEdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.18,0:26:49.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}说服他们让TG Desk以教育折扣价向学校出售游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.18,0:26:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}convinced them to let TG Desk sell their games to schools at an educational discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.28,0:26:51.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们吹嘘的最酷功能是 这个桌面应用
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.28,0:26:51.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The coolest feature that they touted was that the desk app
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.55,0:26:55.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}能够透视游戏内部 追踪学生的进度
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.55,0:26:55.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}would be able to look inside the game and track the progression of your students,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.22,0:26:57.21,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这样他们在游玩时 你可以自动看到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.22,0:26:57.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so as they played, you could automatically see
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.21,0:27:00.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们在学习美国课程标准中的哪些部分
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.21,0:27:00.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which parts of the United States curriculum they were learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.47,0:27:03.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还有他们做MinecraftEdu时的那个取舍
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.47,0:27:03.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There’s also that trade-off that they had with MinecraftEdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.34,0:27:06.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}开发者做的工作越多 老师要付的价格就越高
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.34,0:27:06.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The more work for the developers means a higher price for the teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.90,0:27:10.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}现在开发者必须手动进入游戏集成代码
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.90,0:27:10.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Now the devs have to manually go in and integrate code into the game
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.28,0:27:12.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}才能实现那些酷炫的课程追踪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.28,0:27:12.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to do all the cool curriculum tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.27,0:27:15.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果你想用一大套游戏来覆盖大量课程内容
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.27,0:27:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If you want a large set of games to represent a lot of the curriculum,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.68,0:27:17.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那价格很快就会变得非常昂贵
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.68,0:27:17.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that’s gonna get real expensive real quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.92,0:27:19.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而价签也反映了这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.92,0:27:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and the price tag reflects that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.77,0:27:21.59,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦太好了 是订阅制
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.77,0:27:21.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh great, it’s a subscription model.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.59,0:27:22.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}耶耶耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.59,0:27:22.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Yayyy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.53,0:27:24.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我敢肯定这绝不会反噬他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.53,0:27:24.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I’m sure that won’t come back to bite them!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.37,0:27:28.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这里我们可以看到 他们对学校的态度发生了非常明显的转变
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.37,0:27:28.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There’s a very distinct shift that we can see here in their attitude towards school.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.28,0:27:30.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}MinecraftEdu希望学校改变
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.28,0:27:30.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}MinecraftEdu wanted schools to change,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.46,0:27:32.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让学生在课堂上有更多自主权
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.46,0:27:32.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to give students more agency in lessons,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.63,0:27:37.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}更亲自动手、更高参与度、教数字公民素养、教协作
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.63,0:27:37.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to be more hands-on, higher-engagement, teach digital citizenship, teach collaboration,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.26,0:27:41.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并展望21世纪的学校能教授的新东西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.26,0:27:41.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and look forward to the new things that the 21st century schools could teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.71,0:27:46.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但TG Desk似乎更想顺应学校目前的现状
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.71,0:27:46.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But TG Desk seems like they more want to be alongside school as it is currently.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.42,0:27:50.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但即使这违背了Santeri最初相信的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.42,0:27:50.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But even though it goes against all of the things that Santeri believed in the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.14,0:27:54.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这至少能在他们无法再做MinecraftEdu时缓冲一下打击
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.14,0:27:54.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it’s at least something to cushion the blow if they can’t make MinecraftEdu anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.90,0:27:58.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而在2015年底 这恰恰就发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.90,0:27:58.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And in late 2015, that was exactly what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.07,0:28:04.04,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}微软向Teacher Gaming发来报价 要花一大笔钱买下整个MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.07,0:28:04.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Microsoft sent an offer to Teacher Gaming to buy all of MinecraftEdu for a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.04,0:28:05.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}幸运的是 他们现在对此已有准备
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.04,0:28:05.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Luckily, they were prepared for this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.93,0:28:07.21,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们有新应用了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.93,0:28:07.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They had their new app,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.21,0:28:09.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft的人气仍在下降
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.21,0:28:09.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft was still declining in popularity,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:12.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们做出了艰难的决定 是时候放手了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:12.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and they made the tough decision that it was time to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.92,0:28:14.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们不再需要Minecraft了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.92,0:28:14.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that they didn’t need Minecraft anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.95,0:28:16.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}交易达成了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.95,0:28:16.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The deal went through,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:19.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}现在微软拥有了MinecraftEdu的所有部分
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:19.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and now Microsoft is in possession of all parts of MinecraftEdu:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.90,0:28:22.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}模组、网站、世界库
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.90,0:28:22.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}the mod, the website, the world library,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.47,0:28:24.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}甚至那个不是wiki的wiki
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.47,0:28:24.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}even the wiki that wasn’t a wiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.28,0:28:25.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}2016年7月1日
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.28,0:28:25.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}On July 1st, 2016,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.99,0:28:28.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Joel Levin宣布他将离开Five More Minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.99,0:28:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Joel Levin announced that he was leaving Five More Minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.40,0:28:30.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}回去全职教书
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.40,0:28:30.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and going back to teaching full-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.43,0:28:33.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}作为回应 他把自己的Twitter账号改成了GamerTeachr
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.43,0:28:33.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}In response, he changed his Twitter handle to GamerTeachr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.73,0:28:34.82,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}依然没有字母E
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.73,0:28:34.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}still without the E,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.82,0:28:36.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为他依然那么酷
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.82,0:28:36.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because he’s still cool like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.55,0:28:38.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不过 其他大多数员工都留在了船上
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.55,0:28:38.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Most of the other employees stayed on the ship, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.83,0:28:41.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们准备好看看Five More Minutes会把他们带向何方
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.83,0:28:41.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and they were ready to see where Five More Minutes would sail them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.91,0:28:43.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}再见各位 玩得开心！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.91,0:28:43.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Bye guys, have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.26,0:28:44.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}呃 总之 你们刚才在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.26,0:28:44.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Uh, anyway, what were y’all saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.89,0:28:47.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}微软正在收购MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.89,0:28:47.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Microsoft is acquiring MinecraftEdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.10,0:28:50.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并投资于一个全新且扩展的教室版Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.10,0:28:50.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and investing in a new and expanded version of Minecraft for the classroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.86,0:28:52.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}名为我的世界：教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.86,0:28:52.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}called Minecraft: Education Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.00,0:28:54.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}微软一直在暗中
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.00,0:28:54.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Microsoft has been in the shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.66,0:28:57.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}研究TeacherGaming是怎么做MinecraftEdu的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.66,0:28:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}studying how TeacherGaming made MinecraftEdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.44,0:28:59.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并想从头重做一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.44,0:28:59.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and wanted to redo it from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:03.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}首先 这是基于基岩版的全新版本
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:03.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}First of all, this is a brand new version on top of Minecraft: Bedrock Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.36,0:29:07.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因此 MinecraftEdu将被彻底淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.36,0:29:07.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Because of that, MinecraftEdu is being sunsetted entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.14,0:29:12.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你为它制作的所有世界都将被困在1.8.9版本……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.14,0:29:12.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}All of your worlds that you made for it are going to be stuck in version 1.8.9…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.39,0:29:13.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}永远
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.39,0:29:13.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.06,0:29:17.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且 额外“福利” 你上传到MinecraftEdu世界库的任何地图
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.06,0:29:17.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And bonus any maps that you uploaded to the MinecraftEdu World Library
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.45,0:29:19.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那些你为了帮助其他老师而上传的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.45,0:29:19.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to, you know, help out other teachers
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.95,0:29:22.15,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}现在也都归微软所有了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.95,0:29:22.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}are now also owned by Microsoft.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.15,0:29:23.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以 希望你们对此没意见
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.15,0:29:23.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So, hope you’re all good with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.67,0:29:25.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但别担心 MinecraftEdu用户们！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.67,0:29:25.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But do not worry, MinecraftEDUsers!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.80,0:29:26.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}为了感谢你们的光顾
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.80,0:29:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}For your patronage,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.88,0:29:30.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你们可以免费获得教育版！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.88,0:29:30.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you get Minecraft: Education Edition for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.40,0:29:31.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦 等等 不 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.40,0:29:31.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh. Wait, no, sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.73,0:29:32.74,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你们获得的是……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.73,0:29:32.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you get the…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.74,0:29:34.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}第一年免费？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.74,0:29:34.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}first year for free?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.90,0:29:35.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.90,0:29:35.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.98,0:29:36.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦不
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.98,0:29:36.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:42.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}教育版Minecraft现在采用了大家最爱的商业模式
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:42.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Educational Minecraft is now everyone’s favorite business model:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.06,0:29:43.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}订阅服务
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.06,0:29:43.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}a subscription service.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.57,0:29:47.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}每个学生每年5美元才能使用教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.57,0:29:47.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Five dollars per year per student to use Minecraft: Education Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.48,0:29:49.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但这不是获得它的唯一方式
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.48,0:29:49.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But that’s not the only way to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.13,0:29:54.65,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft教育版也包含在微软面向全校的Office 365套餐中
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.13,0:29:54.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft Education is also included in Microsoft’s school-wide Office 365 plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.65,0:29:59.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这些套餐基本上是让管理员为整个学校开通Office产品的访问权限
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.65,0:29:59.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They’re basically for the administrators to give your entire school access to Office products.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.37,0:30:02.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你至少要拥有A1套餐 才能以每年5美元的价格
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.37,0:30:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You must have at least A1 to be able to rent Minecraft: Education Edition
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.96,0:30:04.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}租用教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.96,0:30:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}at that five-dollars-a-year price.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.72,0:30:07.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但如果你有A3或A5 它就包含在内
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.72,0:30:07.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But if you have A3 or A5, it comes included.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.47,0:30:10.71,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但我的重点是 你无法购买教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.47,0:30:10.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But my point is that you cannot buy Minecraft: Education Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.71,0:30:13.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你必须永远从微软那里租用它
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.71,0:30:13.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You need to rent it from Microsoft forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:15.11,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我还想指出 在Minecraft基岩版中
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:15.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And I do want to note that in Minecraft Bedrock
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.11,0:30:16.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你可以启用教育功能
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.11,0:30:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you can enable educational features,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.48,0:30:18.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但这些与Minecraft教育版的功能并不相同
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.48,0:30:18.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but these are not the same as the Minecraft Education features.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.80,0:30:19.94,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有很多东西缺失
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.80,0:30:19.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There are a lot of things that are missing
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.94,0:30:22.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这让它们对老师来说更难用了 总之谢谢再见
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.94,0:30:22.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and it makes them way, way harder for teachers to use anyway thank you bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.35,0:30:23.91,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且我其实认为 理论上
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.35,0:30:23.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And I actually think that in theory,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.91,0:30:28.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这种订阅模式对老师和微软双方来说其实都可能是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.91,0:30:28.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}this subscription model could actually be a good thing for both teachers and Microsoft.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.19,0:30:29.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但现实情况是
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.19,0:30:29.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But the reality of the situation
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.70,0:30:30.61,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它烂透了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.70,0:30:30.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}is that it’s shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.95,0:30:31.82,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}对老师来说
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.95,0:30:31.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}For teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.82,0:30:33.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}当然 对微软来说不是
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.82,0:30:33.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Not for Microsoft, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.05,0:30:37.29,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}开始使用Minecraft教育版的费用已经大幅下降
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.05,0:30:37.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The price to start using Minecraft Education has significantly gone down,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.29,0:30:38.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这让老师更有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.29,0:30:38.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which makes it a lot more likely that
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.83,0:30:42.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}自己去试一试 看看情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.83,0:30:42.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}a teacher could test it out on their own and see what’s happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.08,0:30:45.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们利用了这样一个事实 大多数老师不会把Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.08,0:30:45.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They lean into the fact that most teachers aren’t going to be using Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.44,0:30:47.17,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}当作主要教学工具
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.44,0:30:47.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}as their main teaching apparatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.17,0:30:53.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}每月10.42美元 就能让全班25名学生使用教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.17,0:30:53.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It is $10.42 a month to get your entire class of 25 to use Minecraft: Education Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.24,0:30:55.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Spotify Premium都比这贵
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.24,0:30:55.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Spotify Premium is more expensive than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.32,0:30:57.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且有了更稳定的收入流
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.32,0:30:57.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And with a more constant revenue stream,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.12,0:31:02.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}理论上他们就有能力投入更多工作 为游戏添加课程和功能
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.12,0:31:02.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they could hypothetically afford to do more work on adding lessons and features to the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.13,0:31:04.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而不是让社区做所有事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.13,0:31:04.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}rather than getting the community to do everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.38,0:31:07.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以这肯定意味着教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.38,0:31:07.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So surely this means that Minecraft: Education Edition
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.44,0:31:11.56,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}会更物有所值吧 毕竟它显然值无限多的钱 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.44,0:31:11.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}will be better value since it’s apparently worth infinite money, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.20,0:31:13.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那么 为了这个视频
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.20,0:31:13.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Well, for this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.43,0:31:16.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我租了教育版 这样你们就不必租了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.43,0:31:16.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I rented Education Edition so that you do not have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.57,0:31:17.65,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}相信我 你们也不该租
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.57,0:31:17.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And trust me, you shouldn’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.65,0:31:19.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让我们去看看这里面到底是什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.65,0:31:19.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Let’s go see what’s actually going on in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.83,0:31:22.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嗯 首先 一个你可能没想到的加分项是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.83,0:31:22.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Well, first of all, something you might not have thought of as a bonus
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.89,0:31:25.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它是基于基岩版构建的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.89,0:31:25.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}is that it’s built off of Bedrock Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.10,0:31:28.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以基岩版支持的所有操作系统它都支持
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.10,0:31:28.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So it’s on every single operating system that Bedrock is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.86,0:31:33.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}是的 PC上有 还有iPad、Chromebook和其他移动设备上也有
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.86,0:31:33.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Yes, on PCs, but also iPads and Chromebooks and other mobile processors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.23,0:31:37.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这自动成为他们对比MinecraftEdu的一大优势
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.23,0:31:37.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}That’s automatically a huge advantage they have over MinecraftEdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.05,0:31:38.05,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但与此同时
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.05,0:31:38.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.05,0:31:40.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}基于基岩版也算是一种劣势
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.05,0:31:40.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}being on Bedrock Edition is kind of a disadvantage,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.90,0:31:43.65,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为它基本上是游戏的降智版本
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.90,0:31:43.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because it’s basically a dumbed-down version of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.65,0:31:45.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且在很多方面都很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.65,0:31:45.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and it’s terrible in so many different ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.78,0:31:47.64,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但我们在这里就不必细说了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.78,0:31:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but we don’t really need to get into that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.64,0:31:51.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有趣的事实 他们每年只更新一次教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.64,0:31:51.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Fun fact: they only update Minecraft: Education Edition once per year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.92,0:31:54.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}当我们获得Chase the Skies更新时
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.92,0:31:54.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}As we got the Chase the Skies drop,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:56.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们获得的是特别的Chase the Clouds更新
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:56.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they got the special Chase the Clouds update,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.60,0:31:59.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那里面包含了当年之前所有的更新
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.60,0:31:59.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which had all of the drops before it that year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.03,0:32:00.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这其实说得通
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.03,0:32:00.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This actually makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.31,0:32:03.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}老师们不想也不需要每三个月更新一次
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.31,0:32:03.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Teachers don’t want or need to update every three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.55,0:32:04.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}至于实际功能
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.55,0:32:04.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}As for actual features,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.91,0:32:07.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有很多专门关于化学的新增内容
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.91,0:32:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}there’s a lot of additions specifically about chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.52,0:32:09.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你可以把方块分解成元素
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.52,0:32:09.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You can decompose blocks into elements,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.62,0:32:11.77,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}用原子粒子制作自己的原子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.62,0:32:11.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}make your own atoms with atomic particles,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.77,0:32:16.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}用这些原子合成化合物 制作自定义方块和物品 比如水下TNT
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.77,0:32:16.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}make compounds from those atoms to construct custom blocks and items like underwater TNT.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.83,0:32:20.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你可以制作小冰弹 扮演Kelvin Deadlock
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.83,0:32:20.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You can make little ice bombs to cosplay Kelvin Deadlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.12,0:32:22.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} 这座城市是我的游乐场！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.12,0:32:22.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} This city is my playground!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.92,0:32:26.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} 甚至可以做一个大象牙膏实验！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.92,0:32:26.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0} And even do an elephant toothpaste reaction!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.98,0:32:30.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你大概会从大约两年前Gneiss Name的这个视频里认识其中很多内容
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.98,0:32:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You might know a lot of these from this Gneiss Name video from about two years ago now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.72,0:32:33.64,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他对教育版提出了很多抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.72,0:32:33.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}He levied a lot of complaints about Minecraft: Education Edition,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.64,0:32:37.51,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}第一个就是关于物质分解器产生的元素
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.64,0:32:37.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and the very first one was about the elements from the material reducer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.51,0:32:39.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}基本上 这个游戏里有一些真实的岩石
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.51,0:32:39.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Basically there are real rocks in this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.47,0:32:43.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}比如安山岩 它是以现实中的真实山脉命名的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.47,0:32:43.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}like andesite, which is named after a real mountain range in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.45,0:32:46.16,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但每当你把这些岩石放进物质分解器
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.45,0:32:46.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But whenever you put those rocks into the material reducer,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.16,0:32:49.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它们给出的并不是现实中这些岩石应有的成分
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.16,0:32:49.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they don’t give you what the actual real life rocks would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.30,0:32:51.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这是一个巨大的错失良机
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.30,0:32:51.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is a huge missed opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.20,0:32:55.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}没能让学生通过Minecraft学习地质学和化学
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.20,0:32:55.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to let the students learn about geology and chemistry through Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.12,0:32:56.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}于是他为此做了一个视频
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.12,0:32:56.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So he made a video about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.59,0:32:59.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并详细列出了现实中这些岩石
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.59,0:32:59.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and laid out a whole section about all of the elements
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.14,0:33:01.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所含的所有元素
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.14,0:33:01.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that the rocks are made out of in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.25,0:33:03.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}对他们来说 本来只需要
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.25,0:33:03.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It would have been so easy for them to literally just
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.89,0:33:07.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}把这些从镜头里复制粘贴进游戏就行了 多么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.89,0:33:07.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}copy and paste those from this shot into the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.32,0:33:08.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你猜怎么着？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.32,0:33:08.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.14,0:33:11.00,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}过去两年他们一直没这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.14,0:33:11.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They haven’t done that for the last two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.00,0:33:12.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}一切都还是错的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.00,0:33:12.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Everything is still in there wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.68,0:33:14.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}依然没有新方块
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.68,0:33:14.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There are still none of the new blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.47,0:33:15.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}比如说 真真切切的铜
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.47,0:33:15.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Like, literal copper.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.76,0:33:18.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我不是化学家 但我很确定铜就是铜
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.76,0:33:18.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I’m no chemist, but I’m pretty sure that copper is copper.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.53,0:33:20.81,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果Gneiss两年都没能让这件事得到改正
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.53,0:33:20.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If Gneiss can’t get this changed over two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.81,0:33:22.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}老实说 我不认为它还会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.81,0:33:22.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I don’t think it’s going to happen, to be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:24.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为他们根本不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.47,0:33:24.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because they don’t fucking care.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.10,0:33:25.74,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}正如他在视频中所说
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.10,0:33:25.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And as he said in his video,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.74,0:33:27.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这正在实实在在地阻碍学习
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.74,0:33:27.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}this is actively impeding learning
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.84,0:33:32.27,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让那些想用最爱的电子游戏学习的学生和老师感到困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.84,0:33:32.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}by confusing students and teachers who might try to learn with their favorite video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.27,0:33:33.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}好吧 我们还是继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.27,0:33:33.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Okay, let’s just move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.06,0:33:33.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.06,0:33:33.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Let’s just move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:36.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}看看教育版独占的方块
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:36.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Looking at the blocks that are exclusive to Minecraft: Education Edition,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.98,0:33:39.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们能看到很多与Edu版相似之处
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.98,0:33:39.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}we see a lot of parallels with Edu.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.08,0:33:42.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}控制方块在新版本中都有对应物
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.08,0:33:42.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The control blocks all have equivalents in the new version,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.02,0:33:44.17,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}谢天谢地 这次贴图好了一些
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.02,0:33:44.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}thankfully with some better textures this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.17,0:33:45.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}说这话让我很痛心
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.17,0:33:45.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And it pains me to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.89,0:33:47.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但宽告示牌没了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.89,0:33:47.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but the wide signs are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.52,0:33:51.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}取而代之的是这些有三种不同名字的黑板类东西
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.52,0:33:51.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}In their place are these chalkboard things that have three different names,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.18,0:33:53.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这让它们极难被搜索到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.18,0:33:53.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}which make them terrible to search up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:55.11,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而每当你加载包含它们的课程时
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:55.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And whenever you load a lesson with them in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.11,0:33:57.51,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它们全都坏了 还朝着错误的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.11,0:33:57.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they’re all broken and facing the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.51,0:33:59.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我  我不知道你怎么能漏掉这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.51,0:33:59.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I– I don’t know how you miss something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.45,0:34:00.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}就像 这  这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.45,0:34:00.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Like, what– what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.90,0:34:05.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果你想试着复刻在MinecraftEdu上的课程 你什么材料都有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.90,0:34:05.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You’ve got all the materials if you want to try and recreate lessons that you had on MinecraftEdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.63,0:34:08.14,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但你只能非常缓慢地一点点加回来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.63,0:34:08.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but you’ll have to add them all back really slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.14,0:34:12.38,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为没有与MinecraftEdu快速建造工具对应的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.14,0:34:12.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because there is no equivalent to the fast building tools from MinecraftEdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.38,0:34:15.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你可以用那个糟糕的/fill命令 我猜
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.38,0:34:15.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}You can use the terrible /fill command, I guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.37,0:34:19.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但Edu做出那些工具 就是为了让老师不必和命令打交道
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.37,0:34:19.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but Edu made those tools so that teachers wouldn’t have to deal with commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.26,0:34:20.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哇 就好像他们根本不在乎似的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.26,0:34:20.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Wow, it’s like they don’t care or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.92,0:34:23.63,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不过还有不少方块没有对应物
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.92,0:34:23.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There are quite a few blocks that have no equivalents though,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.63,0:34:25.01,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}比如数字方块
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.63,0:34:25.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}like the number blocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.01,0:34:25.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“i”方块
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.01,0:34:25.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}the “i” block
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.95,0:34:26.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这孩子会很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.95,0:34:26.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}this kid would be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.83,0:34:30.81,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而非常遗憾的是 所有qCraft方块和物品也没能保留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.83,0:34:30.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and very sadly, all of the qCraft blocks and items didn’t make it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.82,0:34:32.74,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}看来量子也没能称霸多久
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.82,0:34:32.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I guess quantum didn’t rule that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.74,0:34:35.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}作为海龟的替代品 有智能体
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.74,0:34:35.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And as a replacement for the turtles, there is the agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.80,0:34:36.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只不过 天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.80,0:34:36.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Except, oh my god,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.90,0:34:38.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们真的有像样的拖拽式编程
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.90,0:34:38.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they actually have good drag and drop code.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.99,0:34:42.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果你做过“编程一小时”活动 这个你可能会觉得眼熟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.99,0:34:42.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This might look familiar to you if you ever did the hour of code
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.12,0:34:44.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}抱歉 是“AI一小时”
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.12,0:34:44.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}sorry, hour of AI
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.18,0:34:44.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在学生时代
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.18,0:34:44.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}back in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.98,0:34:48.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们还为老师提供了一个单独的程序 叫“教室模式”
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.98,0:34:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They also give teachers a separate program called classroom mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.20,0:34:52.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它给你一张大地图 你可以实时看到每个学生在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.20,0:34:52.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It gives you this big map and you can see where every student is in real time,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.06,0:34:54.69,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你还可以把游戏规则调整改成图形界面操作
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.06,0:34:54.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and you can change game rules to the GUI.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.69,0:34:56.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我得承认 这挺酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.69,0:34:56.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I gotta admit, it’s pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.60,0:34:57.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}挺酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.60,0:34:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.60,0:34:59.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}最好的新功能是相机
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.60,0:34:59.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The best new feature is the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.52,0:35:01.89,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它们显然比不上我的相机
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.52,0:35:01.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They’re nothing compared to my cameras obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.89,0:35:03.33,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为它们不能拍视频
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.89,0:35:03.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because they don’t shoot video.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:06.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但学生可以拍摄他们在课堂上的成果
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.33,0:35:06.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But students can take pictures of what they did in class
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.06,0:35:08.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并把它们放进新的作品集里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.06,0:35:08.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and put them into their new portfolio.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.28,0:35:09.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}课堂结束后
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.28,0:35:09.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Once you’re done in class,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.22,0:35:11.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你只要把作品集导出为PDF
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.22,0:35:11.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you just export the portfolio to a PDF
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:13.00,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}然后交给老师
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:13.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and turn it into your teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.00,0:35:15.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}老师们需要能够向管理者展示
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.00,0:35:15.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Teachers need to be able to show administrators that
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.26,0:35:17.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}游戏里确实有实实在在的事情在发生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.26,0:35:17.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}things are actually tangibly happening in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.96,0:35:19.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而这是一个很好的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.96,0:35:19.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and that’s a great way to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.37,0:35:21.01,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不过这确实让我有点恼火
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.37,0:35:21.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It does piss me off slightly though,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.01,0:35:23.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为它表明他们早就把书与笔做得很好了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.01,0:35:23.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because it shows that they’ve already made books and quills good,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.92,0:35:26.81,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但只限于这个愚蠢的教育版游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.92,0:35:26.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it’s only for this stupid educational version of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.81,0:35:28.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}把那功能带到Java版啊 拜托！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.81,0:35:28.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Bring that to Java, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.42,0:35:31.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们帮助老师的另一种方式是提供一个课程库
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.42,0:35:31.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Another way that they help teachers is by having a lesson library.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.32,0:35:34.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}是的 它和MinecraftEdu世界库非常相似
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.32,0:35:34.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Yes, it is very similar to the MinecraftEdu world library,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.40,0:35:36.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}只不过它在创新方面更进一步 变得更烂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.40,0:35:36.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}except it’s innovating by being even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.67,0:35:40.70,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}一些由微软官方制作的世界真的非常棒
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.67,0:35:40.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Some of the worlds that are officially made by Microsoft are genuinely really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.70,0:35:42.29,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}比如这个AI侦探主题的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.70,0:35:42.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Like this AI detective one,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.29,0:35:45.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}向学生展示在我们的生成式AI……时代
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.29,0:35:45.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}showing students how to tell what is real in our gen-AI…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.95,0:35:46.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如何辨别真假
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.95,0:35:46.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.88,0:35:50.77,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}虽然其中一些世界只是平坦地图中间立着一块告示牌
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.88,0:35:50.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And while some of these worlds are just a sign in the middle of a flat map,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.77,0:35:55.49,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}总的来说 这个库里的世界质量高于MinecraftEdu上的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.77,0:35:55.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}in general the worlds in this library are higher-quality than the ones on MinecraftEdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.49,0:35:58.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但前提是它们真的有世界
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.49,0:35:58.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but that’s only if they actually have a world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.13,0:35:59.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}要知道 这是课程库
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.13,0:35:59.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Ya know, this is a lesson library,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.99,0:36:01.15,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不是世界库
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.99,0:36:01.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}not a world library,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.15,0:36:03.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以你根本不需要有世界
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.15,0:36:03.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so you don’t need to have a world at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.18,0:36:07.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}比如这个IGCSE地理目标3.5·能源
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.18,0:36:07.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Like the IGCSE GEOGRAPHY OBJ 3.5 ENERGY,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.23,0:36:08.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}里面只是写着
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.23,0:36:08.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}where it just says,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.02,0:36:10.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让您的学生在Minecraft里建造一座发电厂
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.02,0:36:10.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}have your students build a power plant in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.63,0:36:11.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}祝你好运 废物
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.63,0:36:11.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Good luck, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.55,0:36:12.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果你在想 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.55,0:36:12.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And if you’re thinking, oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.53,0:36:15.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我只要筛选出那些真的有世界的就行
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.53,0:36:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I’ll just filter for the ones that actually do have a world,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.20,0:36:17.23,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嘿 想得美 因为如果你试着那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.20,0:36:17.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}heh, nice try, because if you try to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.23,0:36:19.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它会说它们其实全都没有世界
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.23,0:36:19.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it says that none of them have any worlds actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.44,0:36:20.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}是你在凭空想象
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.44,0:36:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}you’re imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.88,0:36:22.47,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}非常酷 顺便说一下 这可要花无限多的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.88,0:36:22.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Very cool. By the way, this costs infinite money.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.47,0:36:23.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你们知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.47,0:36:23.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Are you aware of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.40,0:36:25.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这让我很自然地进入下一个部分
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.40,0:36:25.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}That brings me nicely to the next part of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.22,0:36:27.15,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那就是筛选功能根本不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.22,0:36:27.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}is that the filters don’t fucking work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.15,0:36:28.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在Gneiss的视频里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.15,0:36:28.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}In Gneiss’s video,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.09,0:36:31.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他建议他们增加一个按语言筛选这些世界的功能
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.09,0:36:31.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}he suggested that they add a way to filter these worlds by language,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.39,0:36:33.28,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为其中很多不是英语
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.39,0:36:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because a lot of them are not in English.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.28,0:36:35.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}看看 他们真的加了 太疯狂了！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.28,0:36:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And look at that, they actually added that, that’s crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:37.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我喜欢公司听取社区意见的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I love when companies listen to the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.52,0:36:39.90,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}给我看看所有英语的历史课
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.52,0:36:39.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Show me all of the history lessons in English.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.38,0:36:42.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}呃 第二个结果是希腊语的解剖课
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.38,0:36:42.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Uh, the second result is an anatomy lesson in Greek.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.00,0:36:45.97,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}公平地说 这个被标注为英语
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.00,0:36:45.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}To be fair, this one is listed as being in English,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.97,0:36:47.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}大概是创作者不小心标错了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.97,0:36:47.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}probably by accident from the creator,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.88,0:36:49.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但它并没有被标注为历史
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.88,0:36:49.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it isn’t listed as history,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.66,0:36:51.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}或者任何科目
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.66,0:36:51.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}or any subject for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.35,0:36:54.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}紧挨着它的一个是英语的数学课
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.35,0:36:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The one directly next to it is a math lesson in English.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.08,0:36:55.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它和历史没有任何关系
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.08,0:36:55.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}No part of this has history,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.52,0:36:57.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但它却出现在历史搜索里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.52,0:36:57.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it’s here on the history search.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.26,0:37:00.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}事实上 无论你输入什么科目 结果都完全一样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.26,0:37:00.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}In fact, any subject that you put in will have the exact same results.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.68,0:37:04.01,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这些是英语的、与创业相关的所有课程
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.68,0:37:04.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Here are all the lessons that are in English and relate to entrepreneurship,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.01,0:37:07.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}还有计算机科学、电竞和地理
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.01,0:37:07.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and computer science, and esports, and geography.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.13,0:37:09.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦看 是希腊语的心脏解剖课 哇 真疯狂！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.13,0:37:09.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh look, it’s the heart dissection in Greek, wow, that’s crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.87,0:37:10.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}截至本视频发布时
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.87,0:37:10.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}As of posting this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.99,0:37:13.15,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它不再以完全相同的方式出错了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.99,0:37:13.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it doesn’t still work in this exact same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.15,0:37:15.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但它仍然不能正常工作
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.15,0:37:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it still does not work correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.20,0:37:16.54,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以我的观点依然成立
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.20,0:37:16.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So my point still stands,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.54,0:37:18.19,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且这部分已经开始变得冗长了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.54,0:37:18.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and this part’s already starting to drag on,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.19,0:37:18.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以让我们继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.19,0:37:18.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so let’s just move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.92,0:37:22.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这正是Gneiss Name两年前遇到的完全相同的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.92,0:37:22.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is the exact same problem that Gneiss Name had literally two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.88,0:37:24.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这些课程数量很多
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.88,0:37:24.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There are a lot of these lessons,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.02,0:37:26.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以你们应该能搜索它们
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.02,0:37:26.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}so you should be able to fucking search them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.30,0:37:29.74,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}做一个真正能用的筛选功能有多难？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.30,0:37:29.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}How hard is it to make an actual filter that fucking works,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.74,0:37:31.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这不可接受！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.74,0:37:31.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}this is unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.62,0:37:33.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这不可接受
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.62,0:37:33.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.25,0:37:34.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我想说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.25,0:37:34.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I want to make it clear that
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.22,0:37:37.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我要把责任明确归咎于微软
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.22,0:37:37.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I am placing the blame specifically at the feet of Microsoft,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.58,0:37:40.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而不是制作这个版本的个人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.58,0:37:40.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}not the individual people who make this version.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.45,0:37:41.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们知道这些东西是坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.45,0:37:41.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They know that these things are broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.77,0:37:43.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为他们有正常工作的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.77,0:37:43.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because they have functioning eyeballs,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.69,0:37:47.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但他们在该项目上的团队太小了 根本没有时间修复
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.69,0:37:47.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but they are such a small team on this project that they don’t have time to fix them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.89,0:37:49.04,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}微软经常做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.89,0:37:49.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Microsoft does this thing a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.05,0:37:53.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}买下一个东西 然后给一小队开发人员微薄的预算
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.05,0:37:53.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}where they buy a thing and then give a shoestring budget to a small team of developers
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.13,0:37:54.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}告诉他们自己想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.13,0:37:54.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and tell them to just deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.86,0:37:57.11,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这里发生的事显然就是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.86,0:37:57.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is very clearly what is happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.11,0:37:58.87,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}别怪那些普通开发者
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.11,0:37:58.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Don’t blame the individual devs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.87,0:37:59.79,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}怪微软
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.87,0:37:59.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Blame Microsoft.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.79,0:38:03.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}微软的生意之道就是尽可能少花钱
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.79,0:38:03.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Microsoft is in the business of spending as little money as humanly possible
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.06,0:38:04.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}获取尽可能高的回报
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.06,0:38:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to get the highest return possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.72,0:38:07.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你知道2026年做到这一点最好的方式是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.72,0:38:07.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And you know the best way to do that in 2026?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.43,0:38:09.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}是生成式AI
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.43,0:38:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s generative AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.68,0:38:12.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“耶耶耶” 所有人说道
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.68,0:38:12.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“Yayyy,” everyone said.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.20,0:38:15.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}天哪 我们终于要在这个频道上聊生成式AI了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.20,0:38:15.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh god, we’re finally going to talk about generative AI on this channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.50,0:38:16.42,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.50,0:38:16.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.42,0:38:17.36,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}好 让我把话说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.42,0:38:17.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Okay, let me be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.36,0:38:18.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我讨厌AI生成的艺术
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.36,0:38:18.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I hate AI-generated art.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.84,0:38:20.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我讨厌AI生成的文字
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.84,0:38:20.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I hate AI-generated text.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.51,0:38:24.58,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我讨厌每次谷歌搜索顶部都有一个AI概览 就那样对你撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.51,0:38:24.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And I hate that every Google search has an AI overview at the top that just lies to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.58,0:38:27.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我一直在往披萨里加胶水 每天至少吃一颗小石头
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.58,0:38:27.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I’ve been putting glue in my pizza and eating at least one small rock per day,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.99,0:38:29.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我觉得这不太健康
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.99,0:38:29.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and I don’t think it’s healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.18,0:38:32.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我确实认为生成式AI在某些场景下是有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.18,0:38:32.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I do think that generative AI can be useful in some scenarios,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.60,0:38:37.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但它并不能真正节省时间 因为你总是需要一个合格的人来审核
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.60,0:38:37.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but it doesn’t really save time because you always need a qualified human to look over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.26,0:38:41.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且AI带来的好处 不值得用所有人电费上涨、破坏环境
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.26,0:38:41.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And the benefits that AI provides are not worth everyone’s power bills going up,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.43,0:38:44.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}以及把整个经济押在上面来换取
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.43,0:38:42.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}destroying the environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.50,0:38:44.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and staking the entire economy on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.57,0:38:48.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}好了 现在我们可以在有趣的教育版里聊聊AI了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.57,0:38:48.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Okay, cool. Now we can talk about AI in the funny Minecraft: Education Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.50,0:38:49.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}过去几年里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.50,0:38:49.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}For the past couple years,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.50,0:38:51.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}AI一直是这个超级流行的热词
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.50,0:38:51.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}AI has been this super popular buzzword.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.68,0:38:52.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}所以 显然
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.68,0:38:52.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.66,0:38:55.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们想在人们面前摇晃AI这把钥匙串 好说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.66,0:38:55.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they want to jingle the AI keys in front of them to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.19,0:38:57.22,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}嘿 嘿 我们很时髦 我们也懂AI
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.19,0:38:57.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}hey, hey, we’re hip, we also know AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.22,0:38:59.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且我们正在教学生们关于AI的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.22,0:38:59.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and we’re teaching students all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.10,0:39:02.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}有几节课宣称里面有AI
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.10,0:39:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}There are a couple lessons that mention that they have AI in them,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.24,0:39:03.16,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但别被骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.24,0:39:03.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but don’t be fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.16,0:39:08.11,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它们里面实际上并没有像大语言模型那样生成答案的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.16,0:39:08.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}These don’t actually have, like, a LLM in them that’s producing answers or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.11,0:39:13.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它只是用经典的“AI一小时”积木教授AI基础
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.11,0:39:13.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s teaching AI foundations with the classic Hour of AI blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.35,0:39:17.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这和当年qCraft教孩子们量子力学的方式很像
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.35,0:39:17.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s a lot like how qCraft was teaching kids about quantum mechanics.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.06,0:39:17.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}想想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.06,0:39:17.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Think of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.73,0:39:21.76,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft教育版确实使用了真正的生成式AI
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.73,0:39:21.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Minecraft Education does use real, genuine, generative AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.76,0:39:26.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但我没法访问它 因为它被锁在后面 只对真正的老师开放
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.76,0:39:26.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but I couldn’t get access to it because it is locked in the back for real teachers only.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.62,0:39:28.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}隆重介绍AI课程制作器
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.62,0:39:28.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Introducing the AI Lesson Crafter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.92,0:39:31.99,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它利用微软的Azure和OpenAI技术
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.92,0:39:31.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It uses Microsoft’s Azure and OpenAI technology to
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.99,0:39:35.06,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}为老师生成基于Minecraft的自定义课程
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.99,0:39:35.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}generate custom Minecraft-based lessons for teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.06,0:39:38.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}当你只需向Chat要一节课时 谁还需要筛选功能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.06,0:39:38.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Who needs filtering to work when you can just ask Chat for a lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.10,0:39:42.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}每节课都自带一套说明和一份美国教育标准清单
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.10,0:39:42.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}each with their own set of instructions and a list of United States educational standards
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.43,0:39:44.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}说明通过这节课你能达到哪些标准
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.43,0:39:44.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that you’re meeting by doing this lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.31,0:39:46.75,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}目前它只对真正的老师开放预览
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.31,0:39:46.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s currently in preview for real teachers only,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.75,0:39:51.12,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但在这篇文章里 他们说它会在2025年对所有用户开放
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.75,0:39:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but in this article they said it would be available to all users in 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.12,0:39:52.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}真让人震惊和意外
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.12,0:39:52.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Shock and surprise,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.20,0:39:54.57,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}现在是2026年 它还是没出
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.20,0:39:54.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it’s 2026 and still not out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.57,0:39:56.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}GTA 6还是AI课程制作器
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.57,0:39:56.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}GTA 6 or AI Lesson Crafter,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.84,0:39:58.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}请在评论区下注
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.84,0:39:58.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}place your bets in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.25,0:40:01.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}说真的 这整个概念极其可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.25,0:40:01.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Seriously though, this whole concept is extremely scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.39,0:40:05.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}一个修改版的ChatGPT有权替学生决定什么是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.39,0:40:05.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}A modified ChatGPT gets to choose what is real for students,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.18,0:40:09.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}尽管它已经被证明会胡编乱造、撒谎 并盲目附和用户
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.18,0:40:09.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}even though it has been shown to hallucinate and lie and blindly agree with the user.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.46,0:40:13.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果它给出实际上并不存在的教育标准 而他们照做了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.46,0:40:13.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What if it gives educational standards that aren’t actually real and they follow them?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.44,0:40:15.73,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果信息本身就是错的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.44,0:40:15.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What if the information itself is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.73,0:40:18.15,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我认为这真的至关重要
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.73,0:40:18.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I think that it really deeply matters
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.15,0:40:22.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们社会的基础不该被AI
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.15,0:40:22.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}that the base of our society is not being misinformed by AI
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.03,0:40:23.34,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}被他们自己的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.03,0:40:23.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}by their own teachers,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.34,0:40:24.78,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那些他们本该信任的人  误导
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.34,0:40:24.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}who they’re supposed to trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.78,0:40:25.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但我能理解他们为什么这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.78,0:40:25.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But I can see why they did this
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:29.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为在纸面上 它是MinecraftEdu问题的终极解决方案
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:29.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because on paper it’s the ultimate solution to MinecraftEdu’s problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.88,0:40:31.17,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}没有教育标准？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.88,0:40:31.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}No educational standards?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.17,0:40:32.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}AI可以帮你造出来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.17,0:40:32.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The AI can make them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.96,0:40:34.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}哦 制作世界太花时间？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.96,0:40:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Oh, the worlds take too long to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.48,0:40:38.39,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}AI会尝试制作能让你的学生大展创造力的课程
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.48,0:40:38.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The AI will try to make lessons that let your students’ creativity shine
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.39,0:40:42.80,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让每节课都发生在一个适合建造的空白平坦世界上
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.39,0:40:42.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}by having each lesson take place on a blank, flat world that is perfect for building.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.80,0:40:45.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}没有足够符合你想教内容的教案？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.80,0:40:45.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Not enough lesson plans for exactly what you want to teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.46,0:40:48.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}AI可以生成你想要的任何教案
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.46,0:40:48.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The AI can generate whatever lesson plan you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.25,0:40:51.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}公平地说 每当Minecraft以任何方式提到AI时
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.25,0:40:51.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}To be fair, whenever Minecraft talks about AI in any capacity,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.69,0:40:54.94,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们都会确保提醒你 使用前需要仔细核对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.69,0:40:54.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they make sure to say that you need to double-check it before you use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.94,0:40:58.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但我认为这有点像是在推卸责任 两头都想占
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.94,0:40:58.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}But I think that this is kind of a cop-out and trying to have it both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.50,0:41:01.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你得知道人们不会检查两遍 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.50,0:41:01.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Like, you’ve got to know that people aren’t going to check it twice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.48,0:41:03.20,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这就是AI可怕的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.48,0:41:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}That’s the terrible thing with AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.20,0:41:05.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它会满怀自信地对你撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.20,0:41:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It will just lie to you, with full confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.92,0:41:08.30,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}以难以察觉的方式撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.92,0:41:08.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Lie in ways that are difficult to even notice,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.30,0:41:12.24,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}慢慢把你认为的真相侵蚀成万物的平均值
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.30,0:41:12.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}slowly eroding what you thought was true into the average of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.24,0:41:13.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而这一切中最糟糕的是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.24,0:41:13.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And the worst part of all of this is that
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.83,0:41:16.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}由于你无法购买教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.83,0:41:16.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}since you cannot buy Minecraft: Education Edition,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.40,0:41:20.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们可以随时、以任何理由拔掉整个产品的电源
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.40,0:41:20.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they can just pull the plug on the whole thing at any time, for any reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.10,0:41:21.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而那些在过去10年里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.10,0:41:21.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And the teachers that have made payments
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.46,0:41:25.07,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}累计支付了1200美元的老师们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.46,0:41:25.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}adding up to $1200 over the past 10 years
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.07,0:41:28.48,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}将没有游戏、没有课程 很可能也没有赔偿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.07,0:41:28.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}will have no game, no lessons, and probably no compensation
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.48,0:41:30.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}因为这家伙靠削减预算为生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.48,0:41:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}because this guy feeds off of budget cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.72,0:41:32.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如果你想看一个典型的例子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.72,0:41:32.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}If you want to see a prime example of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.67,0:41:35.35,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}看看我们的老朋友TeacherGaming就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.67,0:41:35.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}look no further than our old friend TeacherGaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.35,0:41:37.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}2021年4月17日
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.35,0:41:37.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}On April 17th, 2021,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.10,0:41:39.92,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}TeacherGaming网站从他们的商店页面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.10,0:41:39.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}the TeacherGaming website was changed from their store page
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.92,0:41:40.67,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}变成了这样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.92,0:41:40.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.67,0:41:41.60,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}游戏结束
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.67,0:41:41.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.60,0:41:42.43,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们说道 引用原文
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.60,0:41:42.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They said, quote,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.44,0:41:43.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“尽管我们竭尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.44,0:41:43.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}“Despite our best efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.45,0:41:47.16,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们仍未能让TG Desk应用取得商业成功
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.45,0:41:47.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}we weren’t able to turn the TG Desk app into a commercial success.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.16,0:41:50.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这就是为什么我们将在下个月终止剩余的服务
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.16,0:41:50.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}That’s why we’re pulling the plug on the remaining services next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.72,0:41:54.03,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在那之后 游戏下载、教案、数据分析、课堂
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.72,0:41:54.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}After that, game downloads, lesson plans, analytics, classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.03,0:41:57.54,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}以及TeacherGaming应用和网站都将不再可用”
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.03,0:41:57.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and the TeacherGaming app and websites will no longer be available.”
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.54,0:42:02.10,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}用户只有44天时间下载他们通过Teacher Gaming购买的所有游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.54,0:42:02.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Users had 44 days to download all of the games that they bought through Teacher Gaming,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.11,0:42:03.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}之后它们就会被全部删除
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.11,0:42:03.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and then they would all be deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.95,0:42:05.83,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而这就是他们的全部生意
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.95,0:42:05.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And that was their entire business.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.83,0:42:07.41,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}请记住 对微软来说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.83,0:42:07.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Keep in mind that for Microsoft,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.41,0:42:11.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}教育版只是他们庞大企业帝国中微不足道的一小部分
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.41,0:42:11.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Education Edition is just a teeny tiny part of their huge conglomerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.45,0:42:12.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.45,0:42:12.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}They do not care.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.46,0:42:15.13,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我们在本视频中一次又一次地看到了这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.46,0:42:15.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}We have seen this over and over again in this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.13,0:42:19.64,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}那么 Minecraft教育版那无限的价格 值得吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.13,0:42:19.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}So, is the infinite price of Minecraft Education worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.64,0:42:20.55,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}不值！！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.64,0:42:20.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}NO!!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.55,0:42:24.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}这显然是最烂、最不成熟的Minecraft当前版本
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.55,0:42:24.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}This is easily the worst, most underdeveloped current version of Minecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.66,0:42:28.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且它还是建立在本已糟糕、充满bug的基岩版之上
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.66,0:42:28.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And it’s on top of the already terrible, buggy Bedrock Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.44,0:42:31.95,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}微软应该为这是自己公司的一部分而感到羞耻
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.44,0:42:31.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Microsoft should be embarrassed that this is part of their company.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.95,0:42:38.40,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们15年前制作MinecraftEdu时投入的时间和心血
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.95,0:42:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}The time and attention to detail they put into making MinecraftEdu 15 years ago now
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.40,0:42:39.93,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}如今已全部化为乌有
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.40,0:42:39.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}is all just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.93,0:42:44.50,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我可以谈谈MinecraftEdu如何没有完全按计划进行之类
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.93,0:42:44.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I can talk about how MinecraftEdu didn’t really go according to plan or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.50,0:42:46.46,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}但这个真的是坏掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.50,0:42:46.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}but this is literally broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.46,0:42:47.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}到处都是问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.46,0:42:47.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}All over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.68,0:42:50.72,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而且人们多年来一直在告诉他们它是坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.68,0:42:50.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And people have told them that it’s broken for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.72,0:42:52.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而他们什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.72,0:42:52.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and they haven’t done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.52,0:42:55.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而作为一个号称教育性的产品
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.52,0:42:55.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And as a supposedly educational product,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:59.37,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它连唯一的工作 提供真实信息 都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:59.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}it fails at its only job of providing true information.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.37,0:43:00.59,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}在研究这个视频的过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.37,0:43:00.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}While researching this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.59,0:43:03.45,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我真的很喜欢上了游戏化教育
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.59,0:43:03.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I really came around to liking gaming in education.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.45,0:43:04.74,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它真的有效
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.45,0:43:04.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It really does work,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.74,0:43:07.62,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而教育版本可以如此出色
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.74,0:43:07.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and Minecraft: Education Edition could be so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.62,0:43:10.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它由一家资金雄厚的大公司打造
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.62,0:43:10.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It’s created by a big company with tons of funding.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.26,0:43:12.96,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}它本可以轻松超越MinecraftEdu
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.26,0:43:12.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}It could be better than MinecraftEdu easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.96,0:43:17.53,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}正因如此 微软却只让整个项目苟延残喘 才如此可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.96,0:43:17.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Which is why it’s so sad that Microsoft just keeps this whole thing on life support instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.53,0:43:20.88,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}我一直很难给这个视频想一个结尾
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.53,0:43:20.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}I’ve been having a really hard time trying to make an ending for this video.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.88,0:43:24.86,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}很难是因为 实在没有什么让人感觉良好的方式来表述这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.88,0:43:24.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And it’s difficult because there isn’t really, like, a feel-good way to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.86,0:43:26.32,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}微软有两个选择
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.86,0:43:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Microsoft has two options.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.32,0:43:29.02,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}要么他们开始资助教育版
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.32,0:43:29.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Either they can start funding Education Edition,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.02,0:43:30.18,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}调更多人手过去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.02,0:43:30.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}move more people over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.18,0:43:32.44,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}并通过让它成为它本该成为的真正版本
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.18,0:43:32.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and show that they actually care about education
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.44,0:43:35.68,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}来证明他们真的关心教育
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.44,0:43:35.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}by making this the true version that it was always meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.68,0:43:36.66,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}或者……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.68,0:43:36.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.66,0:43:38.26,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他们可以继续什么都不做
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.66,0:43:38.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}they can just continue to do nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.27,0:43:41.08,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让这个本来很好的版本烂在藤上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.27,0:43:41.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}and let this perfectly good version rot on the vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.08,0:43:45.25,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}而鉴于他们上个月刚解雇了4800名员工
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.08,0:43:45.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}And given that they just fired 4,800 workers last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.25,0:43:48.31,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}你们大胆猜猜我觉得哪个更有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.25,0:43:48.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}take a wild guess at which one I think is more likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.19,0:43:49.98,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.19,0:43:49.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.98,0:44:19.84,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}让我用ChatGPT来问我人生中的每一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.98,0:44:19.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}Let me ask ChatGPT about every single thing in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.84,0:44:21.52,CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}他对那只羊做了什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.84,0:44:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur6.0}What is he doing to the sheep!?
